    <node id="&quot;GEL PERMEATION CHROMATOGRAPHY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gel Permeation Chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight distribution of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography (GPC) is a chemical reaction that is being used to study the chemical properties of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polyether-PU."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to characterize low-density polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to determine the molecular weight of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to study the molecular weight distribution of polymers, including PS microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the size and structure of molecules, including those involved in the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a type of chromatography being used to analyze the molecular weights of polymers in the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of the PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a process used to analyze the properties of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a type of technology used to analyze the molecular weight of the frass of yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polymers, including polypropylene (PP)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to characterize the depolymerization of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to separate and analyze the molecular weight of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography, or GPC, is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the depolymerization and biodegradation of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of PS polymers and their biodegradation products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gel permeation chromatography is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of materials, including plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8d27c41781c64c2b407faecc4bc31466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567c36cf69b624a7ec0d891d3bd15163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbedc06292e5cf07fbca1958d8587e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe381daaa91bbff20758798e5baf82b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d9491734042920c5911740665415835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53dd546535ef4247004faab1fa475889&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2417ca11674320d88eecdf4cb66f9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76783f53d38e8c7423dff747f0413d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad389953d78e790a40a9267c5b591c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70eb294c60e73338ed59a2eddf057c1e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THERMOGRAVIMETRIC ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thermogravimetric analysis (TGA) is a chemical reaction that is being used to study the chemical properties of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric analysis is a biochemical measure used to analyze the thermal degradation of microplastics before and after metabolism by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric analysis is a technique used to analyze the thermal stability of polyether-PU."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric analysis is a type of technology used to analyze the thermal properties of the frass of yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermogravimetric analysis is a technique used to analyze the thermal properties of materials, including plastics."</data>
