    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOURIER TRANSFORM INFRARED SPECTROSCOPY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy (FT-IR) is a chemical reaction that is being used to study the chemical properties of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a method used to analyze the chemical composition of a sample."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of polyether-PU."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to characterize the molecular structure of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to characterize the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technology being used to analyze the biodegradation of PE and WC by the lesser waxworm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of polystyrene foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of PS polymers and their biodegradation products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of materials, including plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99a98d885ec6495c4dc902866c4ab9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f2303f3680e9313daac77bb7e27e7da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-207d77d551e893eda6578be68ca3d0db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567c36cf69b624a7ec0d891d3bd15163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76783f53d38e8c7423dff747f0413d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70eb294c60e73338ed59a2eddf057c1e</data>
    </node>
