    <node id="&quot;ZOPHOBAS ATRATUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zophobas atratus is a type of microorganism that can degrade certain types of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus, also known as the superworm, is a species of darkling beetle that has been found to have a unique ability to biodegrade plastics, particularly polystyrene, polyethylene, and polypropylene. The superworm's larvae are capable of breaking down and modifying the backbone of various plastics through gut-microbe-dependent depolymerization, with the help of associated microorganisms such as Pseudomonas sp. Zophobas atratus can ingest and degrade plastics, including polyethylene and polystyrene, and is also capable of biodegrading low-density polyethylene and polystyrene. Additionally, the superworm has been found to biodegrade and mineralize polystyrene, and can even digest Styrofoam. The insect's ability to digest and biodegrade plastics makes it a potential solution for addressing plastic pollution. Zophobas atratus is being studied for its potential applications in biodegradation and plastic waste management, and its unique gut microbiome, which is capable of degrading plastics, has been a subject of interest for further research. The superworm's larvae have been found to consume more polystyrene when provided with wheat bran, and the species has been used in studies to investigate the biodegradation of polystyrene, particularly in the context of microbiome research. Furthermore, Zophobas atratus has been found to be capable of degrading polypropylene via gut-microbe-dependent depolymerization, and can rapidly biodegrade polyethylene in a matter of hours. Zophobas atratus is also capable of biodegrading microplastics, and its larvae are used in studies to understand the effects of microplastics on the environment. However, it is worth noting that Zophobas atratus may experience oxidative stress due to its plastic-degrading activities. Overall, Zophobas atratus is a valuable model system in the study of biodegradation, and its ability to biodegrade certain types of plastics makes it a significant species in the context of plastic pollution and waste management. 

Note: The descriptions that referred to Zophobas atratus as a genus of beetles or insects, or as microorganisms, have been corrected to reflect that Zophobas atratus is a species of darkling beetle. The contradictory information has been resolved to provide a single, coherent summary.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939f85d52d9301668deab282264e5fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df045e015825dac8935c9c6d8a402cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896c5c0e4d1805ded38b335876a02f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779ca6b59945309c6bf5040c9fb474ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-260d8c268067de32e5ac98d66ab70a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3c2c01c935a178261a31b8ed897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8076792f39f6c801b538312a7b45fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91ffc7c76e8e0a1757d91f7cf62f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44f9d05edb3efaf7fdb8f0f1517549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422e833d3381bd5fd0b5a3d63d9047f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e127a4930b6154498b93c2e94f2b7c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-104d99248e84b2776ff5ca17c285a7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c0c246e98a503a16ace92f28394b584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22e4b8000531766cffd145ef32353af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d76ad321e1c68d5f139cdb94d5bf42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1a88a43b40afd043514c5f6898ee71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4265fd894f71345b4ef09c26e6adbda5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5251cc2ed910c3785b2c7242b7cbc11e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30a7209d626a6319ba5600bea7f27299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d642e5476221b3ea202c68d7e6070b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a53d37e7ff6850fc55177f325e49861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce7cf71b094ef4329d3da3b628438bec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5caa980be616efa237401a957b69019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a47a21d3773bb9ea3318d47bb077597f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c06d3562ff01465354b3a954b1145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3253e8d41785f994d1c6fcc2b6c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eda80cb027c8107defa00011d491b002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eb7955dc484d5f656e1be7b406abb3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c