      <data key="d1">"Snails are a type of invertebrate that has been found to ingest microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Snails are a type of mollusk that has been found to be capable of biofragmenting plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Snails have been found to have a gut microbial community capable of degrading polyether-PU foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Snails, specifically Achatina fulica, are known for their ability to ingest and consume plastic diets containing recalcitrant plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Snails are a type of soil invertebrate that are capable of degrading organic materials, but not polystyrene (PS)."</data>
