    <node id="&quot;PU FOAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PU Foam is a type of product that is being consumed by mealworms, and its biodegradation is being studied."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU foam is a product that is used as a feed for mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU foam is a type of plastic material used in this study to investigate its biodegradation by yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU foam is a type of plastic that can be ingested and consumed by certain insects, such as the yellow mealworm."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU foam is a type of polyurethane foam that is being tested for its biodegradability by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PU foam is a type of plastic that is consumed by superworms and yellow mealworms, with a morphology that changes over time."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2338bb97657d74ab5d8a444849037692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dfcb3f2424bd027b5888293a0d01d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bf00317a1d0d9ffccab121661a18a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4c43611ebe237c15c5f9201a9f8dbee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c16dd402d0a926c1a975280e2b32e84e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae42540a18795e5e2ad9054b7a0edfc3</data>
    </node>
