    <node id="&quot;DNA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DNA is a biological molecule that contains genetic instructions for the development and function of all living organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is a genetic concept related to the mealworm larvae, isolated from the digestive tract using a QIAamp PowerFecal DNA kit."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is a genetic concept that is being extracted and sequenced from the PS-degrading bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is a molecule that contains genetic instructions for the development and function of living organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is the genetic material being extracted from the mealworms for microbial community analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is the target of the extraction process, with the goal of analyzing its content."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is extracted from the isolates and used for molecular identification and phylogenetic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is the genetic material of the polystyrene-degrading bacteria, and is used to identify and characterize the bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"The given text appears to be a DNA sequence, which is a genetic concept that contains the instructions for the development and function of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is the molecule being extracted and sequenced to analyze the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA, or deoxyribonucleic acid, is a molecule that contains the genetic instructions for an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is a genetic material that was used to identify the species of the lesser waxworm through genomic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is the genetic material extracted from the microorganisms in the gut of the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA is a genetic material that contains the instructions for the development and function of living organisms."</data>
