      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RDP Classifier is a software tool used for taxonomic classification of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"RDP classifier is used to classify 16 S rRNA gene sequences in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RDP classifier is a software used to classify the microorganisms in the microbiome analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"RDP Classifier is a software used for taxonomy analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"RDP Classifier is a software used to analyze the taxonomy of each 16S rRNA gene sequence against the Silva 16S rRNA database."&lt;SEP&gt;"The RDP Classifier is a software used to analyze the taxonomy of the 16S rRNA gene sequences."</data>
