    <node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL COORDINATE ANALYSIS (PCOA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PCoA is a statistical method used to analyze and visualize the microbial community structure in the mealworms' gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal Coordinate Analysis (PCoA) is a statistical method used to analyze microbial community composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal Coordinate Analysis (PCoA) is a technique used to analyze and compare the diversity of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal coordinate analysis (PCoA) is a statistical method used to analyze the structure of microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal coordinate analysis (PCoA) is a method used to analyze the community structure of gut microflora."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal coordinate analysis (PCoA) is a method used to analyze and visualize microbial community composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal coordinate analysis (PCoA) is a technique used to analyze the microbial community structure in the gut of the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal Coordinate Analysis is a method used to compare the gut microbial communities of mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c2cfbb4289b0cc4c8b69884f6d57c447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-165679126b891785de849b020c1548f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449dceb5649c6baa34ecc2218cd3e9e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5193c909193ddd73442615b27f4f9be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb5478046e8b80ff49694ccdb8f92fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df147b253e29abfa812d060407051e45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b1e554820493d86eb8bc96ba8bef37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7a93f0b3dbebad30b6aeabec429a40</data>
    </node>
