    <node id="&quot;URETHANE BOND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL BOND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of chemical bond that is present in polyether-PU foam and is susceptible to hydrolysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Urethane bond is a type of chemical bond present in polyether-PU foam that undergoes hydrolysis during mealworm ingestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Urethane bond is a type of chemical bond that is present in polyurethane foam."</data>
