    <node id="&quot;BENZENE RINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Benzene rings are a component of the polystyrene feedstock that are broken down during the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benzene rings are a type of functional group that is present in polyether-PU foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benzene rings are a type of chemical structure that is present in polystyrene and may be involved in its degradation."</data>
