    <node id="&quot;ENZYMES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOMOLECULE"</data>
      <data key="d1">ENZYMES are biological molecules that play a crucial role in the biodegradation of various substances, including plastics. They are proteins secreted by microorganisms, such as mealworm larvae, and can catalyze specific chemical reactions, including those involved in the breakdown of polymers. ENZYMES can break down plastic waste, and their presence in the mealworm's digestive tract can affect the degradation process. They are involved in the biodegradation of polyethylene (PE) microplastics by the mealworm larvae and can also degrade synthetic polymers, although they may have a low bio-reactivity towards plastics containing covalent pairs of carbon bonds. Additionally, ENZYMES can catalyze chemical reactions, such as the breakdown of plastics, and are often involved in biodegradation processes. Some specific types of ENZYMES, such as cholesterol esterases, proteases, and lipases, are being investigated for their ability to biodegrade polyurethane. ENZYMES secreted by Tenebrio molitor larvae contribute to the biodegradation of microplastics, and their role in PET biodegradation has been observed under antibiotic suppression. Overall, ENZYMES are biological molecules that can be used to degrade plastic waste, and further research and engineering may be necessary for large-scale implementation.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cfbb4289b0cc4c8b69884f6d57c447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9095195e9cf06b9887c03abde6284d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-032b3b0fe0366e6e76e86abf8c48d200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ad3152e855d5b8085e1e61af57515d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40357516e3f9dd4b2969b73efe444c28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be14442602a613e0ddfef5b30f6d023d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582f48080aab075de76c9c590558639f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8518832c2d3e002c8acf71795e306144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf2753a9a78b282c1ca2c0539e3203d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdeaa1a437ba819412de45788aa119c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119b3f144b4ec234392cca17031bd7a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1a88a43b40afd043514c5f6898ee71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a131a2ef26575f9f4b81bb622ef823e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25215becbc007a60f24b86a2d6aaf26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af</data>
    </node>
