      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A process by which microorganisms break down materials, potentially involving the degradation of polyether-PU foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial Attack is a biological process that breaks down polymers into smaller molecules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial attack is a process by which the intestinal microorganisms of the larvae break down the PS into smaller molecules."</data>
