      <data key="d1">"Tetrahydrofuran is a chemical compound that is used as a solvent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a chemical solvent that is commonly used in GPC analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a chemical used to extract PS from the frass of T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used for extraction and analysis of polystyrene (PS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a chemical used in the analysis of the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used to dissolve PVC and frass specimens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a chemical used to stop biological activity in experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used to extract polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used to extract the polystyrene plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a solvent used to extract polystyrene from frass for analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran is a type of solvent used to extract the PS residue from the frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tetrahydrofuran, or THF, is a chemical used as a solvent in the study to extract and analyze plastics."</data>
