    <node id="&quot;POLYSTYRENE MICROPLASTICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polystyrene Microplastics are a product that is being exposed to earthworms, causing a significant increase in ROS levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are a type of product that can affect the gut microbiome of mice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Small plastic particles made of polystyrene that can be biodegraded by the larvae of Galleria mellonella."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are a type of plastic that is degraded by certain microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are a type of plastic that can induce microbial dysbiosis and dysfunction in surrounding seawater."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are small plastic particles that can be harmful to the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are a type of microplastic that can be ingested by organisms and cause harm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are a type of plastic that can be toxic to earthworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene microplastics are small plastic particles that are being studied for their effects on the environment and human health."</data>
