    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMAN HEALTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Human health can be harmed by plastic pollution, including through the ingestion of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health can be harmed by plastic waste, which can contaminate food and water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is a concern when considering the use of insects that degrade Styrofoam as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is a measure that can be harmed by plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is a health measure that can be affected by the presence of microplastics in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is affected by the environmental pollution caused by the accumulation of polystyrene (PS) and other plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health refers to the well-being of individuals, which can be affected by microplastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health refers to the well-being of humans, which can be affected by plastic pollution through the ingestion of microplastics and other mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health refers to the well-being of humans, and is affected by plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is affected by microplastics and other environmental pollutants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is affected by plastic pollution, with potential harm to humans through consumption of plastics and exposure to plastic particles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is affected by the consumption of plastics, including the potential for toxic chemicals to leach into food and water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health refers to the overall well-being of humans, which can be affected by environmental pollution and other factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is a biological concept that is related to the nutritional recommendations provided by the FAO."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is a health measure that is affected by the presence of microplastics in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Human health is affected by the accumulation of plastic waste, including polystyrene, in the environment."</data>
