    <node id="&quot;FOOD SECURITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Food security can be threatened by plastic waste, which can contaminate food and water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food security refers to the availability of sufficient, safe, and nutritious food for all people, and is a concept being explored in relation to insect-based food sources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food security refers to the availability and accessibility of nutritious food, with implications for the potential of insect-based food products to address global food security challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food security refers to the availability of safe and nutritious food, which can be affected by microplastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food security is a type of ecological concept that is being studied for its potential impact on the environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f7d44b3f99233bb4389ceea0cd62617&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba22196a59b67cbf67af7d76a039af1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e67971bdf45c447f2409fddb80e0d8a</data>
    </node>
