    <node id="&quot;THERMOPLASTIC POLYMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thermoplastic polymers, such as polyethylene, are types of plastics that can be melted and reformed."</data>
