      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Macromolecular structure is the molecular structure of plastics, and it affects the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Macromolecular structure refers to the large-scale structure of molecules, such as polymers."</data>
