    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC BIODEGRADATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plastic biodegradation is a biological process that occurs when insects, such as the Black Soldier Fly (BSF), Mealworm (MW), and Greater Wax Moth (WM), break down and transform plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastic materials, with Tenebrio molitor and its gut microbiome playing a key role."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics into smaller components."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which the mealworm larvae break down the plastic feedstock."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of breaking down plastics by microorganisms, which can be influenced by various factors such as the type of microorganism and the environmental conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which plastics are broken down into smaller molecules by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which plastics are broken down into smaller components by microorganisms and insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics into smaller components, and is considered to be a potential solution to the problem of plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastic materials, with yellow mealworms and their gut fungi playing a key role."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which plastics are broken down by living organisms, such as yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which plastics are broken down into smaller components by living organisms, such as Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic biodegradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics into smaller components."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896c5c0e4d1805ded38b335876a02f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eca628f2d85c664191a5205194ec475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e2601f950d62c093ceb86612b2374f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c39e41f4f36c9c6854fa71508c35a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d33654bada6ddaf4917586dd5fd41e9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7500fe4985cb2b885f9eb244ed3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c84ac252cb9ce906354bda2ad1113aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79f3fee16e3f983c9f04a66e4d50760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a</data>
