    <node id="&quot;ANTIOXIDANT DEFENSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Antioxidant defense is a biological process that helps to protect the mealworm larvae from oxidative stress, involving enzymes such as SOD, GST, and CAT."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antioxidant defense is a biological process that occurs in mealworms to counteract oxidative stress caused by microplastic ingestion."</data>
