    <node id="&quot;PE-FED LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE-fed larvae are a life stage of mealworm larvae that have been fed a diet of PE."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE-fed larvae refer to the stage of development of superworms and yellow mealworms that are fed a diet of polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c1f0f043d44950fae05e8207a298d4a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32e296ef016e2403df45f75eedee219</data>
