    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plastic pollution is a type of ecological concept that is being studied for its potential impact on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic Pollution is a major environmental issue that refers to the contamination of the environment with plastics, specifically the accumulation of plastic debris and waste in the environment. This accumulation of plastic waste can have negative impacts on ecosystems and human health, highlighting the need for effective biodegradation solutions. Plastic Pollution is being studied and addressed through various means, including the study of biodegradation of plastics, to mitigate its effects. The issue is a significant global concern, with plastics accumulating in oceans and land, affecting ecosystems and human health. The accumulation of plastic waste in the environment can harm ecosystems, wildlife, and human health, and it is essential to address this problem to prevent further damage. Biodegradation processes can help mitigate Plastic Pollution, and research aims to contribute to understanding how to mitigate this major environmental issue. Overall, Plastic Pollution is an ecological concept that is being studied as a major environmental problem, and it is crucial to take action to reduce the accumulation of plastic waste in the environment and promote a healthier ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution refers to the accumulation of plastic waste in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution refers to the accumulation of plastic debris in the environment, including in oceans and landfills."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic pollution refers to the accumulation of plastic waste in the environment, which can have negative effects on ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf7769e197cb664b8d9e41a4c93eec50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba22196a59b67cbf67af7d76a039af1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8076792f39f6c801b538312a7b45fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf8041a3cdcd6091f6c96b8b67229df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eca628f2d85c664191a5205194ec475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce7cf71b094ef4329d3da3b628438bec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52fc2936b4d2a771dbc2d6a37eeb710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88706f91768bcf0eaa7a49ef2d4b771f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5d8df2e13d3902379597b08eb0e08db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff8edff56325c22cfed3871f4fbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908d878ed4e7fc36f3af71a5be7f2ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2e818c436fabed80b9d3d720ebf491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a69982e6abe36c2a0d4a70b78720ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908b8bfa7e446694958cf9bd0cfbc583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af9ad6e808e93b61ec40d6ba4131fda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af</data>
