      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oceans are large bodies of saltwater that cover much of the Earth's surface, and are often affected by plastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oceans are physical features that can be polluted by plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oceans are one of the environments where plastic wastes, including polystyrene, can accumulate."</data>
