      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ecological Concept is a general term that could refer to any concept related to microorganism ecology, but the text does not provide enough information to give a comprehensive description."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecological concepts refer to the study of the relationships between organisms and their environment, and are important for understanding the impacts of plastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecological concept refers to the study of the relationships between organisms and their environment, including biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecological concept is a concept related to the study of the relationships between organisms and their environment."</data>
