      <data key="d1">"Atrazine is a toxic substance that can contaminate soil and be remediated through certain methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Atrazine is a type of herbicide that is often used in agriculture, and can have negative impacts on ecosystems and human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Atrazine is a type of herbicide that can cause oxidative stress and gene expression changes in earthworms."</data>
