      <data key="d0">"PHYSIOLOGICAL RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Developmental toxicity is a physiological response that can occur in organisms as a result of exposure to microplastics and nanoparticles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Developmental toxicity is the process by which certain substances, such as microplastics, can harm the development of organisms."</data>
