      <data key="d1">"Biodegradation of polyethylene is the process by which microorganisms break down polyethylene into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The yellow mealworm gut microbiome plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polyethylene, indicating a relationship between the two entities."</data>
