      <data key="d1">"Illumina MiSeq is a high-throughput sequencing platform used for analyzing the gut microbiome of mealworms and other organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for sequencing DNA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a technology used for DNA sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing technology used to investigate the fungal communities in the gut of superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a technology used for amplicon sequencing of 16S rRNA and ITS gene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a technology used to sequence the 16S rRNA gene and investigate the effect of plastic diets on the bacterial community of superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for analyzing the genetic material of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a technology that is used for sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina Miseq is a sequencing platform used for robust environmental microbial community analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a platform used for sequencing the 16S rRNA genes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina Miseq is a biological concept used to investigate the impact of mask diets on the gut bacterial community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for sequencing DNA."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina MiSeq is a technology used for DNA sequencing."</data>
