    <node id="&quot;IRON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Iron is a nutrient mentioned in the study as a trace element that is essential for the activity of nitrogenase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Iron is a nutrient that is essential for maintaining homeostasis in plants, with its regulation involving selective protein degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Iron is an element present in EPS and frass, with potential uses in various industries and applications, particularly in construction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Iron is a nutrient that is essential for the activity of nitrogenase."</data>
