      <data key="d1">"Sulfur is a chemical element that is present in LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads and is used as a sole carbon and energy source by isolated bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sulfur is a nutrient mentioned in the study as a trace element that is essential for the activity of nitrogenase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sulfur is a nutrient that is essential for maintaining homeostasis in plants, with its regulation involving selective protein degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sulfur is a nutrient that is essential for the activity of nitrogenase."</data>
