      <data key="d1">"Gut flagellates are hosts to Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which play a role in shaping the nitrogen-fixing community in dry-wood termites."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut flagellates are hosts to Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which shape the nitrogen-fixing community in dry-wood termites."</data>
