      <data key="d1">"Dry-wood termites are hosts to gut flagellates and Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which contribute to the nitrogen-fixing community."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dry-wood termites have a gut microbiota that includes Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which shape the nitrogen-fixing community."</data>
