      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mealworm beetle is a species of beetle that has been studied for its gut-associated bacteria and its potential as a novel food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mealworm beetle, Tenebrio molitor, is a beneficial pest that can biodegrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mealworm beetle is an insect whose larvae are capable of biodegrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mealworm beetle, also known as Tenebrio molitor, is a beneficial pest with immune defenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mealworm beetle is the parent species of the mealworm, mentioned in the context of the study."</data>
