      <data key="d0">"ECONOMIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A circular economy is an economic system that aims to reduce waste and promote the reuse and recycling of materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular Economy is an economic model that aims to reduce waste and promote sustainable consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Circular economy is a concept that involves the conversion of waste into valuable products, such as biomass, fertilizers, and biofuels."</data>
