      <data key="d1">"Nutrient broth is a medium used to cultivate and assess the biodegradation ability of isolated bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a nutrient source used to culture bacterial isolates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a nutrient used to grow PM S1, with and without the addition of LDPE, HDPE, and PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nutrient broth is a nutrient-rich substance used to culture gut bacterial strains, containing ingredients such as beef extract, peptone, and NaCl."</data>
