    <node id="&quot;MICROBIAL DEGRADATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbial Degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is a process by which microorganisms break down materials, including polyethylene terephthalate (PET), contributing to waste management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation refers to the process by which microorganisms break down materials, in this case, plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation refers to the process by which microorganisms break down organic materials, such as plastics, into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is a biological process that is being studied as a potential solution to plastic pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down organic materials, such as polystyrene, into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down organic materials, including plastics like polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process by which microorganisms break down plastics, including polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics, such as polyethylene, into smaller components."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is the process by which microorganisms break down plastics into smaller molecules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation refers to the process by which microorganisms break down plastics and other organic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial degradation is a type of biodegradation process that involves the use of microorganisms to break down polymers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eca628f2d85c664191a5205194ec475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42ef7860e1f056d47955d0d13a15cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a53fba6106c000acc0dac3484d37a4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908b8bfa7e446694958cf9bd0cfbc583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1006283f24aba2aa605f9e719f36cf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f3828bbe45c2c38004a29d55dcbf40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e833cbc3a0a6e2c80e1b69da50317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3646a65acc7cbdc1d20742888b17613a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c</data>
    </node>
