    <node id="&quot;RHODOCOCCUS RUBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rhodococcus ruber is a strain of bacteria that has been found to colonize, form biofilms, and biodegrade polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodococcus ruber is a strain of microorganism that can colonize, form biofilms, and biodegrade polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodococcus ruber is a type of bacterium that can degrade synthetic plastics, including polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;Rhodococcus ruber is a bacterium belonging to the phylum Actinobacteria and family Nocardiaceae. It is a polyethylene-degrading and polystyrene-degrading bacterium, capable of colonizing and forming biofilms on various surfaces, including polyethylene and polystyrene film surfaces. Rhodococcus ruber is also known to be capable of degrading other types of plastics, such as PET, and is able to utilize the degraded products. Additionally, it is an EPS-degrading microorganism and can degrade alkanes, a type of hydrocarbon. Rhodococcus ruber has dedicated transport systems that allow it to utilize the degraded products of PET. It has been found to contribute to the biodegradation of polystyrene and is capable of partially biodegrading this plastic. Overall, Rhodococcus ruber is a versatile bacterium with a range of abilities that make it useful for biodegradation applications. Note that there is a description that incorrectly identifies Rhodococcus ruber as a fungus, but the majority of the descriptions and scientific knowledge confirm that it is a bacterium.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-82390f5824b5ef543e1f258b1a47e167&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd104d06a1ede06701ecfa96bccc2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678bd592bfdda3f6dd8f2a6659de7fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0c513c586aa89e48e9570525bfc5366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7432cb0d6c74fd2dd80b065fbad26b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d3c25b9affee2f535cb531a09a2384&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf8041a3cdcd6091f6c96b8b67229df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20bc31ca22e33a7b244779745e9eeb73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a882603f777986db9d8fc65cea91dce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c4d027474e8769f550ce290c9391ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4443da1fe36ec7133cd5add18d1957a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4652e08c4ac6887914d0deebe761b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f2fd4b2e978e6745e0dde602114a826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0efd7a9e4443dc5d3dfe588c7f7efc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0462cccaa75cf13e553e16026939880b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a54f7d9e0a43fb94e2fc35f93656fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aad5e97885ea1116956513db244b8fb6</data>
