    <node id="&quot;TENEBRIO MOLITOR LINNAEUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">Tenebrio molitor Linnaeus, also known as the yellow mealworm, is a species of beetle that has been found to play a significant role in the biodegradation of plastics. The larvae of Tenebrio molitor Linnaeus, commonly referred to as mealworms, have been discovered to be capable of degrading various types of plastics, including polystyrene, low-density polyethylene foams, and other plastics like PVC. The larvae's gut contains microorganisms that are responsible for this biodegradation process. Tenebrio molitor Linnaeus has been identified based on its morphology and coloration, and its larvae are known to chew and eat Styrofoam. The species has been studied for its ability to biodegrade plastics, and its larvae have been found to be effective in breaking down these materials. Additionally, Tenebrio molitor Linnaeus has been found to have nitrogen-fixing gut bacteria, which further contributes to its unique characteristics. Overall, Tenebrio molitor Linnaeus is a species of insect that has been identified as a key component in the biodegradation of plastics, with its larvae being a crucial part of this process.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457d054c08a16428ed81526fc2ddce41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39598f698094d1663ca3438bc143bc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ea4395a1eb1886507c72cdf33db169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10474cc69c90eb0c245c8f55d1ec2834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38e212e8bab88c4d7b6d63a157e27c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db579d338d8f90574e3ac67a3ae9938d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b6237c84f002117fbfe7575d9cdd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76783f53d38e8c7423dff747f0413d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad389953d78e790a40a9267c5b591c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4443da1fe36ec7133cd5add18d1957a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff228c7711f94fb27152b187b1fa3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa10245aaff722ac7d69e73bed8afe74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59dab99372af01b60a073d8eac17870f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b74f16813537103549cdcb6770abaea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530244abdca5889849fcf86f017ebd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54215690a971d0637c3a6fa61d10f685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908b8bfa7e446694958cf9bd0cfbc583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af9ad6e808e93b61ec40d6ba4131fda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91df729b04e3d570337e02872cf1c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
    </node>
