    <node id="&quot;RHODOTORULA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNGI"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rhodotorula is a fungal genus that significantly increases in plastics-fed groups, and is associated with plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodotorula is a fungus that shows higher relative abundances in PS-fed and PE-fed yellow mealworms, indicating its association with plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodotorula is a genus of fungi that is associated with the degradation of polyethylene in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodotorula is a type of fungus that is dominant in the gut of Tenebrio molitor larvae fed with different types of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhodotorula is a type of microorganism that is strongly associated with the biodegradation of plastics, particularly PP, PU, and EVA."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e127a4930b6154498b93c2e94f2b7c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb6f13dbe3de759712fa3a0c9780470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7500fe4985cb2b885f9eb244ed3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f07da33b55bf8a25fe06beee23e90e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRYPTOCOCCUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNGI"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cryptococcus is a fungal genus that significantly increases in plastics-fed groups, and is associated with plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptococcus is a fungus that shows higher relative abundances in PS-fed and PE-fed yellow mealworms, indicating its association with plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptococcus is a genus of fungi that is associated with the degradation of polystyrene in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptococcus is a genus of fungi, with species carnescens, which belongs to the family Tremellaceae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptococcus is a type of fungus that is dominant in the gut of Tenebrio molitor larvae fed with different types of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cryptococcus is a type of microorganism that is strongly associated with the biodegradation of plastics, particularly PP, PU, and EVA."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e127a4930b6154498b93c2e94f2b7c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb6f13dbe3de759712fa3a0c9780470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9904e6f38706256e15c7957f8f0527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7500fe4985cb2b885f9eb244ed3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f07da33b55bf8a25fe06beee23e90e</data>
    </node>
