      <data key="d0">"FUNGI"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Issatchenkia is a genus of fungi that is associated with the degradation of both polyethylene and polystyrene in superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Issatchenkia is a genus of fungi that is found in the gut of yellow mealworms."</data>
