    <node id="&quot;SPHINGOBACTERIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sphingobacterium is a bacterium associated with PS diet in superworms, suggesting its involvement in plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sphingobacterium is a genus of bacteria that is associated with the degradation of polystyrene in superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sphingobacterium is a type of bacteria found in the gut microbiome of the Tenebrio species."</data>
