    <node id="&quot;DYSGONOMONAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dysgonomonas is a bacterium associated with PS diet in superworms, implying its potential role in plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria that is associated with the degradation of polystyrene in superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is associated with PS degradation in the gut of superworms, and its relative abundance increases in PS-fed superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dysgonomonas is a microorganism associated with PET degradation."</data>
