    <node id="&quot;GUT BACTERIAL COMMUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut bacterial communities are the microbial communities present in the gut of yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut bacterial communities refer to the collection of bacteria that live in the gut of an organism and play a crucial role in its overall health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut bacterial communities refer to the community of bacteria that live in the gut of an organism and play a role in its health and digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut bacterial communities refer to the community of bacteria that live in the gut of an organism, in this case, the insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut bacterial communities refer to the community of microorganisms that live in the gut of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut bacterial communities refer to the complex communities of microorganisms that are present in the gut of mealworms and play a role in the biodegradation of polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e127a4930b6154498b93c2e94f2b7c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2281f98bcfd555a703fd86232dfa42fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b74f16813537103549cdcb6770abaea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb6f13dbe3de759712fa3a0c9780470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3f07da33b55bf8a25fe06beee23e90e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04683827a8d88bc2fa28ae73ccc0714f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUT FUNGAL COMMUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNGI"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut fungal communities are the fungal communities present in the gut of yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut fungal communities refer to the collection of fungi that live in the gut of an organism and play a crucial role in its overall health and development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut fungal communities refer to the community of fungi that live in the gut of an organism and play a role in its health and digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut fungal communities refer to the community of fungi that live in the gut of an organism, in this case, the insect larvae."</data>
