    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANGROVIBACTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mangrovibacter is a bacterium associated with PU diet in superworms, indicating its potential role in plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mangrovibacter is a type of microorganism that can be found in the gut microbiome of insect larvae, including superworms and yellow mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ec1a5b2913dd6782ff1e0533dd57325f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8076792f39f6c801b538312a7b45fe</data>
