      <data key="d1">"Plastics consumption is a biological process investigated in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastics consumption is the process by which organisms break down and utilize plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastics consumption refers to the process of the yellow mealworms eating and digesting plastics."</data>
