    <node id="&quot;EXPERIMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Experiment is a process used to study the consumption of EPS by mealworms, with varying beddings and pre-treatments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Experiment refers to the study conducted to investigate the effects of plastic diet on the growth and survival of larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The experiment is the overall process of testing the biodegradation of different types of plastics by mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The experiment refers to the study of T. molitor's consumption of plastics, including the methods and results."&lt;SEP&gt;"The experiment is a scientific process used to study the effects of different plastics on mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The experiment refers to the study being conducted on the T. molitor larvae, in which they are being fed different diets and their growth and development are being measured."</data>
