      <data key="d1">"Weight changes are used to assess the effect of plastic diets on the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight changes refer to the changes in weight of the larvae during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight changes refer to the changes in weight of the yellow mealworms during the study, used as a measure of their growth and development."</data>
