      <data key="d1">"ATR-FTIR analysis is a biochemical measure used to characterize the functional groups in the frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"ATR-FTIR analysis is a biological concept used to analyze the breakdown of plastic by superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"ATR-FTIR analysis is a biological concept that refers to the use of infrared spectroscopy to analyze the functional groups of microorganisms and nanoplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"ATR-FTIR analysis is a type of biochemical measure used for analyzing the chemical composition of nanoparticles."</data>
