    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEIGHT CHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSIOLOGICAL RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Weight change is a physiological response of T. molitor larvae to biodegrading PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight change is a physiological response to plastic consumption in superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight change refers to the change in weight of the mealworms during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight change refers to the change in weight of yellow mealworms during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Weight change is a physiological response of T. molitor larvae to microplastic ingestion, with significant weight loss observed in larvae fed with microplastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6cc0afd02f25b584d6e3a755fc7272b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1fbf409e74e27aa2b223e54f2e0def&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2417ca11674320d88eecdf4cb66f9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69679184959639a1ff81c7392cd5cef5</data>
    </node>
