      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The gut-bacterial microbiome is a biological concept that refers to the community of bacteria in the gut of the yellow mealworm."&lt;SEP&gt;"The gut-bacterial microbiome refers to the community of microorganisms that live in the gut of superworms and yellow mealworms."</data>
