      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL CHARACTERISTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut of superworms is a physical characteristic that can be inhabited by Pseudomonas sp. for biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The gut of superworms is a physical characteristic that plays a role in the biodegradation of plastics such as PE and PS."</data>
