      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hyphopichia is a fungus that is predominant in the guts of both bran-fed superworms and yellow mealworms, but decreases or disappears in plastics-fed groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hyphopichia is a predominant fungus in guts of both bran-fed superworms and yellow mealworms."</data>
