      <data key="d1">"Gut fungal community refers to the community of fungi that live in the gut of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The gut fungal community refers to the collection of fungi that live in the gut of superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The gut fungal community of Tenebrio molitor larvae is composed of various fungi, including Rhodotorula, Cryptococcus, Aspergillus, and Cladosporium."</data>
