      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NMDS is a statistical method used for analyzing the microbial community."&lt;SEP&gt;"NMDS, or non-metric multidimensional scaling, is a statistical method used to analyze the gut bacterial community of superworms and yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"NMDs is a measure of the differences in the gut microbiome of mealworms fed different diets."</data>
