    <node id="&quot;PLODIA INTERPUNCTELLA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plodia interpunctella is a species of insect that has been found to possess the ability to biodegrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plodia interpunctella is a species of moth whose larvae have been found to have gut bacteria that can biodegrade PS."&lt;SEP&gt;Plodia interpunctella, also known as the Indian meal moth, is a species of insect that has been found to have the ability to biodegrade various types of plastics, including polyethylene, polypropylene, and polystyrene. This species of moth is capable of chewing and eating plastic packaging materials, and has been reported to penetrate polyethylene films, as well as polyvinyl chloride and polypropylene packaging films. The gut of Plodia interpunctella contains bacterial strains such as Enterobacter absburiae strain YT1 and Bacillus sp. YP1, which are believed to contribute to its ability to degrade plastics. Plodia interpunctella has also been found to be capable of biodegrading organic wastes and can modify the backbone of various plastics. Additionally, it has been compared to Tenebrio molitor in terms of biodegradation, highlighting its potential as a species that can break down and degrade plastics. Overall, Plodia interpunctella is a species of insect that has been extensively studied for its ability to degrade plastics, and its unique characteristics make it an important subject of research in the field of biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;"Plodia interpunctella is a species of moth whose larvae are capable of biodegrading polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd104d06a1ede06701ecfa96bccc2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-323c02b97d9365a25761a155d358b17a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0c513c586aa89e48e9570525bfc5366&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9972450967f344c19cb747d7ce649e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91ffc7c76e8e0a1757d91f7cf62f568&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e05bc34fccfca5e177064daf8346866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a228b2d8328bdce2419d34f8f59bc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27c93b39534612a0492f52ce1f3cd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566afea8a2a89bd188f68d0afa1bb173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd1ab39969c669dba42f162e8497c23f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b42ef7860e1f056d47955d0d13a15cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4da90774e2e5cb1fea30fd5aa390760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb5478046e8b80ff49694ccdb8f92fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ba7d6b1b5275089cbabe56bc33b92e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530244abdca5889849fcf86f017ebd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-694aaaa7c2839ea048d46b6a2bb13748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
