    <node id="&quot;POLYMER CRYSTALLINITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polymer crystallinity is a physical property of plastics that affects their degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYDISPERSITY INDEX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polydispersity index (PDI) is a chemical property that is being used to study the chemical properties of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is a measure of the distribution of molecular weights in plastics, being used to characterize the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is a physical property of plastics that affects their degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is a biochemical measure that refers to the ratio of the weight-average molecular weight to the number-average molecular weight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is a property of microplastics that changes during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is a measure of the molecular weight distribution of a polymer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The polydispersity index, or PDI, is a measure of the molecular weight distribution of the plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-345c72af5aa26d5c4e06d7df5d8a1c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ad3152e855d5b8085e1e61af57515d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHORE HARDNESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shore hardness is a measure of the hardness of plastics, being used to characterize the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Shore hardness is a physical property of plastics that affects their degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Shore hardness is a measure of the hardness of plastics, such as PS, PSr, PSp, and EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Shore hardness is a physical property being measured in the materials being studied."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-41635122b30ee45048cc885b38fff6ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d47d39d364c5c66ef3fc32ef741ca63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DENSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A physical property of materials, used to describe the properties of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a measure of the mass per unit volume of plastics, being used to characterize the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a physical property of plastics that affects their degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a physical property of plastics that does not have a significant correlation with their consumption by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a measure of the mass per unit volume of polystyrene (PS) feedstocks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a physical property of PS waste materials that affects their biodegradation by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density refers to the physical property of the polystyrene materials, which can influence the consumption rate and degradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a physical property of polystyrene (PS) that affects its biodegradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Density is a physical property that refers to the mass per unit volume of a substance, which is used to describe the growth patterns of T. molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96aac7c9638ee245b9db5df3ec1d2a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b858a4eb57553f5b1ae041e1c7160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9111bd088e1990cde867c6d85cf28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5740f0973ff804cae61f6fc12f3e3753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf662c8e784d14a3a4dba2e89041aa4a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HT-GPC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"HT-GPC (High-Temperature Gel Permeation Chromatography) is an analytical technique used to study the degradation of polyethylene by yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a high-temperature gel permeation chromatography technique used to determine the molecular weight of PP."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polymers, such as PE mulching film."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technology being used to analyze the molecular weight of the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC, or high-temperature gel permeation chromatography, is a technique used to separate and analyze the molecular weight of substances at high temperatures."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technology used to analyze the molecular weight of plastic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a biochemical measure used to determine the molecular weight values of virgin and residual PE-MPs."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a high-temperature gel permeation chromatography technique used to characterize the molecular weight of the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC, or High-Temperature Gel Permeation Chromatography, is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight distribution of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to determine the molecular weights of polyethylene polymers after biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of LDPE and its biodegradation products."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to analyze the molecular weight of polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to characterize the depolymerization of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"HT-GPC is a technique used to characterize the molecular weight and molecular weight distribution of LDPE before and after biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab754d1dc0a02ee3f869d2b082a710e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd73d3cca5434181ee9dd1ad1b8f8ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2359b10600f30376fe077f5e942cc999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-639bb2429f20c4fe3994c4a0d15f3295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaffdadca6e8a3e9721b2dcb031b93f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbedc06292e5cf07fbca1958d8587e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b1e554820493d86eb8bc96ba8bef37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-152e743d95b64fab136afadf0304d459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af682f78e3e8970d7d70b027a8f79116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843d5746868067bce1a2f15dfc1571e2</data>
    </node>
