    <node id="&quot;BLAST2GO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blast2GO is a biological concept and tool used for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research, aiding in understanding biological processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is a software being used to annotate the genes with KEGG pathways."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is a software tool used for gene annotation and pathway mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blast2GO is a tool used for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research."</data>
