    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSCRIPTOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transcriptome is the complete set of transcripts in a cell or organism at a specific developmental stage or under specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transcriptome is the complete set of transcripts in a cell or organism, being analyzed in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transcriptome refers to the set of all RNA molecules in the mealworms, which is analyzed for changes in response to PP degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transcriptome refers to the complete set of transcripts in an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transcriptome refers to the complete set of transcripts in a cell or organism, which can provide information on gene expression."</data>
