    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENE EXPRESSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gene expression in both the larvae and gut bacteria is altered to form a system conducive to plastic degradation, with the larvae's gut functioning as an effective bioreactor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene expression is the process by which genes are turned on or off, being studied in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene expression refers to the process by which the information encoded in a gene is converted into a functional product."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene expression is a biological process involved in the expression of genes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d5f4bda412174e8b173f180d9b4311ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b759b81206d0e33e320f2d61e540ae47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723</data>
    </node>
