      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Illumina Sequencing is a biological concept used to detect the changes in the intestinal microbiome of the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina sequencing is a high-throughput sequencing technology being used to analyze the transcriptome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina sequencing is a technique used to determine the order of nucleotides in a DNA molecule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Illumina sequencing is a technology used to analyze the gut microbiome of mealworms."</data>
