    <node id="&quot;CRYSTALLINITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Crystallinity is a measure of the degree of crystalline structure in plastics, being used to characterize the plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of plastics that affects their degradability by mealworms, with amorphous plastics being more easily degraded."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity refers to the degree of order in the arrangement of molecules in a material, which can affect its properties and behavior."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a property of PET polymers that affects their degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property used to describe the structure of microplastics and frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a type of physical property that is affected by the biodegradation of HDPE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of plastics that affects their biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property that refers to the degree of order in the molecular structure of a material, which can affect its behavior and interactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of PET that affects its biodegradation rate, with high crystallinity restricting enzymatic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of plastics that can affect the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a measure of the degree of order in a polymer, with higher values indicating greater crystallinity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a measure of the degree of order in the molecular structure of PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of polyethylene that affects its biodegradation, with higher crystallinity making it more resistant to enzymatic reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of polyethylene that affects its biodegradation, with higher crystallinity resulting in lower biodegradation rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of polymers that affects their biodegradation, with higher crystallinity making it more resistant to enzymatic reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Crystallinity is a physical property of polymers that affects their biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31b2c5f608adabba1cc6986356e96598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1679027e80b766e0469f7323db15b497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6675480dfd01dcb533166d01b8e5482e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6afbb58ebe9108893daf7e65d59fac39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30a7209d626a6319ba5600bea7f27299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96aac7c9638ee245b9db5df3ec1d2a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1006283f24aba2aa605f9e719f36cf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326a8dda1cdd196236b9c836192c76f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b673e7590aa1d03b7721694ed73cd74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCBI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NCBI (National Center for Biotechnology Information) is an organization that provides a database for DNA sequences, where the nucleotide sequencing data of the lesser waxworm was submitted."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is a database that stores genetic information, including 16S rRNA gene sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is a database used for bioinformatics analysis and storing genetic information."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is an organization that provides a database for nucleotide sequences, which was used for sequence analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is an organization that provides a database for nucleotide sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is an organization that provides access to genetic sequences and databases, including GenBank, for molecular identification and phylogenetic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI stands for National Center for Biotechnology Information, which is a database that provides access to a wide range of biological information."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI, or National Center for Biotechnology Information, is an organization that provides access to biological databases and tools."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is an organization that provided a database for the submission of raw data."&lt;SEP&gt;"NCBI is an organization that provides access to genetic information and other biological data."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4d71b4e70d7c620ee64c709aaeae634a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51daa29515cc5a431055291627bcb199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e8cdca8afb1d7153fba5e3c11b1f669&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b74e88d1f94354055e078b38af6a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e9eb740edf53e540b468122b302cb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8b79a6f4c112b0b62ada6756140e3e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5eb6a8326b4977801e2f7694a2c750&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f</data>
    </node>
