      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yang et al. are researchers who have published studies related to PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. are researchers who have studied the biodegradation of plastics by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a reference to a research study or publication that is cited in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a research group that has studied the biodegradation of plastics by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a research group that has studied the effects of Styrofoam consumption on mealworms, including the conversion of Styrofoam carbon into CO2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. refers to a research group that has studied the biodegradation of plastics by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. are researchers whose previous reports are referenced in the methods and procedures for the collection and analysis of the residual polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. refers to a research group that has published studies on the biodegradation of polystyrene by superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is an organization that has conducted research on the consumption of polystyrene (PS) by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. are researchers who published studies on the biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a group of researchers who have studied the biodegradation of EPS by insects such as Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a reference to a study that reported the presence of PE-degrading bacteria in the digestive tract of the Indian meal moth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a research group that has studied the consumption of plastics by mealworms, including polystyrene and polypropylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a research group that has studied the gut microbiome of insects and its relation to plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. refers to a research study or publication that is cited in the text, providing information on the degradation of PP polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. is a researcher or group of researchers who have conducted studies on the biodegradation of plastics."</data>
