      <data key="d0">"PHYSIOLOGICAL RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Larval Weight is a physiological response measured in the study to evaluate the impact of plastic on insect metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Larval weight is a biological marker that reflects the growth and development of mealworms, with its pattern varying over time and in response to different diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Larval weight is a biological measure that is used to assess the growth of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Larval weight is a measure of the weight of the yellow mealworm larvae."</data>
