      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mortality rate is a biological measure that is used to assess the survival of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality rate refers to the rate at which mealworms die during the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortality rate is the measure of the number of Tenebrio molitor that die, which can be affected by the type of feed provided."</data>
