      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Depolymerase is a type of enzyme involved in the degradation of PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"Depolymerase is a type of enzyme that is involved in the breakdown of PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"Depolymerase is an enzyme that is involved in the degradation of plastics by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Depolymerase is an enzyme that is produced by the gut microbiome of T. molitor larvae and contributes to PET degradation."</data>
