      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hydrolases are a class of enzymes that have the greatest changes in the mealworms fed with LDPE, involved in breaking down ester bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrolases are a type of enzyme involved in the degradation of PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrolases are a type of enzyme that is involved in the breakdown of PET."</data>
