    <node id="&quot;G. MELLONELLA LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"G. mellonella larvae are microorganisms that are similar to mealworms and are used for comparison."&lt;SEP&gt;"G. mellonella larvae are microorganisms that degrade PS and lignin through a series of enzymatic reactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"G. mellonella larvae are the immature stage of the G. mellonella insect, used in the experiment to degrade Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"G. mellonella larvae is a type of insect larvae with similar plastic-degrading features to mealworms."</data>
