    <node id="&quot;SHORT-CHAIN FATTY ACIDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Short-chain fatty acids are metabolites that are produced by the microbiota and play a role in intestinal homeostasis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Short-chain fatty acids are metabolites that are produced from the degradation of wax, and are involved in the regulation of gene expression in G. mellonella larvae."</data>
