      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yang is a person who studied the biodegradation of polyethylene and plastic mixtures in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied the degradation of polystyrene by insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a person who studied the digestion of PS by mealworms and reported on the results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who studied the biodegradation of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has published studies on the biodegradation of plastics by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is an author who has written about the biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms and superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has published a study on the biodegradation of polyethylene by bacterial strains from the gut of plastic-eating waxworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of polyethylene and plastic mixtures in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is an author who wrote a study on the biodegradation of polyethylene and poly mixtures in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who published a study on the biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has collaborated with Ghatge on studies related to the biodegradation of polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has contributed to studies on the biodegradation of polyethylene, including the effects of environmental factors and pro-oxidant additives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of expanded polystyrene and low-density polyethylene foams by Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who demonstrated that a mealworm strain can survive on EPS alone for one month."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who studied microplastics pollution and reduction strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who studied the biodegradation of polystyrene wastes in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who studied the biodegradation ability of Tenebrio molitor larvae and the effects of physicochemical properties of plastics on biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang is a researcher who published a study on enhancing bioenergy production with carbon capture of microalgae."</data>
