    <node id="&quot;RNA-SEQ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RNA-seq is a high-throughput sequencing technique used to analyze the transcriptome of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"RNA-seq is a technique for analyzing the transcriptome of an organism."</data>
