    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EGGNOG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATABASE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"eggNOG is a database of orthologous groups of genes that provides a hierarchical, functionally and phylogenetically annotated resource for understanding gene function and evolution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47ee82f655853704e6653d8146973278</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genome is a genetic concept that is associated with the study of the genetic material of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Genome refers to the complete set of genetic information in an organism, and is an important concept in understanding the biology of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DNA sequence is part of the genome, which is the complete set of genetic information in an organism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-47ee82f655853704e6653d8146973278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4af956dbe737dee68ab6b9834fe2fcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15780e819c8b33749983834a5716c31f</data>
    </node>
