    <node id="&quot;WASTE MANAGEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Waste management is a process that can be improved through the biodegradation of polyethylene by larvae, but it is not a feasible solution due to the high energy requirements and low value of the products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management is a process that involves the collection, transportation, and disposal of waste, with potential applications in environmental protection and public health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the process of handling and disposing of waste, including plastics, in an environmentally responsible manner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the process of handling and disposing of waste, with implications for the potential of insect-based biodegradation to promote sustainable waste management practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the processes used to handle and dispose of waste, including plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management is the process of handling and disposing of waste, including polystyrene, in an environmentally responsible manner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the process of managing and disposing of waste materials, such as plastics, in an environmentally friendly way."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the process of handling and disposing of waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the practices and strategies used to manage and mitigate the impact of waste, including plastic waste, on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management is an environmental issue that involves the management of waste, including plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management refers to the processes and practices used to handle and dispose of waste, including plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management is the process by which waste, including plastic waste, is disposed of or recycled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Waste management is the process of handling and disposing of waste, including plastic waste."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e0ec64a7c629b14bfb6652f1960a337c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff93a2e1d68c6ed1fcd9f720197238f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568e2e90ce0d3bbb4e21079f4252f5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8624d79db8ed1c4488f890a1d0c085a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cefffe48b3d2ec347f880c77300fc041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c16f995987af72f86486559556052e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e67971bdf45c447f2409fddb80e0d8a</data>
