      <data key="d1">"A Dounce homogenizer is a tool used to homogenize samples, in this case, to break down the gut cells of mealworms to release bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dounce homogenizer is a tool used for homogenizing samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dounce homogenizer is a device used to homogenize the gut tissues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dounce homogenizer is a product that is used to homogenize the gut cell suspension."</data>
