      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL FEATURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A centrifuge tube is a tool used to hold the sample for centrifugation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centrifuge tube is a tool used for separating samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centrifuge tube is a type of laboratory equipment used to hold and separate samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centrifuge tube is a laboratory container used to separate substances based on density."&lt;SEP&gt;"The centrifuge tube is a device used to hold the gut suspension."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centrifuge tube is a device used to rinse the PS film with sodium dodecyl sulfate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Centrifuge tube is used to store the intestine samples."</data>
