    <node id="&quot;PHYLOGENETIC TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A phylogenetic tree is a biological concept used to show the relationships between different organisms based on their genetic material."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phylogenetic tree is a diagram that shows the evolutionary relationships between different organisms, including the bacterial isolates from the gut of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phylogenetic tree is a diagram that shows the evolutionary relationships between different organisms, including the polystyrene-degrading bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phylogenetic tree is a diagram that shows the evolutionary relationships between different organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a biological concept used to represent the evolutionary relationships between different organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a concept used to visualize the relationships between different species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a diagram that shows the evolutionary relationship between different species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a biological concept used to study the relationships between different microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a method used to show the evolutionary relationships between different species, including bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phylogenetic tree is a graphical representation of the evolutionary relationships among microorganisms, including strain YT2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a biological concept that refers to the use of evolutionary relationships to analyze the relatedness of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a graphical representation of the evolutionary relationships between bacterial strains."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a graphical representation of the evolutionary relationships between different organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A phylogenetic tree is a diagram that shows the evolutionary relationships between different species, and it was used to identify Achroia grisella."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a graphical representation of the evolutionary relationships between different species of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phylogenetic tree is a biological concept used to classify the isolated microorganisms based on their evolutionary relationships."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-652bf0615ec39fba0cedd113ec87a78a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cdc0cc71ed5e76f044e4db50f81ad2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d71b4e70d7c620ee64c709aaeae634a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01bf9080cbf55e62c0b26d0e054bd1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568e2e90ce0d3bbb4e21079f4252f5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361c5d4ba2e879627f4eb7fc4011ee3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f488d8d4434d57d1a775a22333caa04b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b74e88d1f94354055e078b38af6a180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f59d5d10f08e8107f36bff5a4c93ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af5eb6a8326b4977801e2f7694a2c750&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6fd56772ef66691cf6f1c613ba42e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1</data>
