    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TENEBRIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio is a genus of insects that may have a gut microbiome similar to that of A. diaperinus, which may be related to plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio is a genus of insects, specifically beetles, that includes several species, such as Tenebrio molitor and Tenebrio obscurus. These species, particularly T. molitor, are commonly known as mealworms. Tenebrio species are known for their ability to biodegrade certain plastics, including polyethylene and polystyrene. The larvae of Tenebrio species have been found to have a gut microbiome that can degrade polystyrene. Tenebrio molitor and Tenebrio obscurus are the most commonly studied species within this genus, and they have been used in various studies to explore their potential to degrade plastics. Additionally, Tenebrio species have been found to be hosts for certain microorganisms, such as Klebsiella oxytoca and Strain BIT-26T. Tenebrio species are also commonly found in stored products and are known for their ability to penetrate packaging materials. Overall, Tenebrio is a genus of insects that is being studied for its potential to degrade plastics and its unique characteristics, and it includes species such as Tenebrio molitor and Tenebrio obscurus.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9095195e9cf06b9887c03abde6284d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc908e62eec4d1d05265c6e451cca84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8c6850a83a1c6efd4f1a3a37a0a8181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23046f647dab4d4caebd663db9aecde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b30daa90b5c91314e1d65e87f191166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88706f91768bcf0eaa7a49ef2d4b771f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1b1db6ffab6f4cfea7a525785a2fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51daa29515cc5a431055291627bcb199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d043948723ae25a365e297c98300be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908d878ed4e7fc36f3af71a5be7f2ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988ef111808996ddbe6e483d6505ab45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f2fd4b2e978e6745e0dde602114a826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a69982e6abe36c2a0d4a70b78720ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb5478046e8b80ff49694ccdb8f92fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37f447b9d6a8b38f80be0854c9c294af</data>
