    <node id="&quot;MINERALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Minerals are a type of nutrient that is necessary for the growth of mealworms, and are lacking in Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minerals are nutrients that are found in Tenebrio molitor L., making it a good source of nutrition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minerals, such as calcium and magnesium, are abundant in Tenebrio molitor larvae and are essential for various biological functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minerals are essential nutrients that are not found in plastics, and their lack can influence the growth and viability of mealworms."</data>
