      <data key="d2">chunk-302543e7a2fdb3596cc8a10e7072ec01</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TENEBRIO MOLITOR L.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">Tenebrio molitor L., also known as the yellow mealworm, is a species of insect that is rich in protein and has been studied for its behavior, growth, and interaction with its environment. It is a type of mealworm beetle that has been found to have a unique ability to biodegrade various plastics and other materials, including polystyrene, polyethylene, PVC, and vinyl plastics. This ability is made possible by the presence of a diazotrophic community in its gut, which contributes to nitrogen fixation. The ingestion of these materials leads to significant changes in its gut microbiome. Tenebrio molitor L. is capable of degrading and biodegrading microplastics, as well as consuming and digesting various types of waste, including lignocellulose. It is affected by moisture, which influences its growth rate and development, and the ingestion of microplastics has significant implications for environmental studies. As a food source, Tenebrio molitor L. can be added to broiler feed without negatively affecting growth performance and carcase characteristics, making it a suitable alternative protein source for livestock feed. Additionally, it is being considered as a source of animal protein for humans in bioregenerative life support systems. The bacterial strain Mixta tenebrionis sp. nov. was isolated from Tenebrio molitor L., highlighting its importance in understanding the biodegradation of plastics. Overall, Tenebrio molitor L. is a versatile and valuable species that has the potential to contribute to sustainable solutions for food production and plastic waste management.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-146789a250a0dbaae0d8438de692e191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aac53ba8b358857c4dcd3b6cd9e8991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d8f385513fcff2125529486530ad5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c1e1694d44433fcf53dc8120c479ca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe381daaa91bbff20758798e5baf82b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf8041a3cdcd6091f6c96b8b67229df2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d9491734042920c5911740665415835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c038f908eb10a4a5715fb9cff3e05527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81610bdb5fdb95d9a333b42668532b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422e833d3381bd5fd0b5a3d63d9047f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-706b5d3a2fa68c3f52b58132d05b7165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302543e7a2fdb3596cc8a10e7072ec01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a81144d30653377d6d90e26c4497eb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cbd81fc528c18f42514a2a74d4921e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9424d3ce58d3ff2e0adc795d24fe84f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a7768b61a3d166f2cd01d4e87ac88cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-728d6b0b96814c5c3c7b93042e9b9856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bae14ee5ac26fe661b539bccaa825fb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2934b88523093a8bba74cc29a0c775e3</data>
