    <node id="&quot;EDIBLE INSECTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Edible insects are a potential source of nutrition for humans and animals, and their use could be expanded through the degradation of plastics like Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects are a type of food resource that includes Tenebrio molitor and other insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects, such as Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas morio, are a potential source of nutrition for humans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects are insects that are considered a food source and have a high nutritional value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects are a type of food source that includes mealworms and other insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects are a type of food that is being considered as a sustainable alternative to traditional animal products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects are a type of microorganism that is being studied for its potential use as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Edible insects, such as mealworms and crickets, are used as a source of protein and other nutrients for human consumption."</data>
