    <node id="&quot;POLYSTYRENE WASTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polystyrene waste is a significant environmental problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene waste is a type of environmental pollutant that can harm ecosystems and human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene waste is a type of plastic waste that can be degraded by certain microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene waste is a type of plastic waste that is harmful to the environment and is being studied for its biodegradability by mealworms and other microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene waste is a type of plastic waste that is difficult to degrade and can pollute the environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56604c68c2f6221f63a4afa5d457e8ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a221e0c62ecd5a2502ec0a4473ab0999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-188daf7716cd1d683a79562bf4d6ab90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2934b88523093a8bba74cc29a0c775e3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EPS WASTE&quot;">
