      <data key="d1">"EPS waste is a significant environmental problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS waste is the environmental problem that the study aims to address."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS waste refers to waste containing extracellular polymeric substances, which can have harmful effects on the environment."</data>
