      <data key="d1">"TMLp, or Tenebrio molitor larvae powder, is a nutritional supplement."&lt;SEP&gt;"TMlp is a test substance, a mealworm powder fed with expanded polystyrene, administered orally to the rats in different concentrations."&lt;SEP&gt;"TMlp, or Tenebrio molitor larvae powder, is a nutrient source used in experiments to assess its effects on cell viability and toxicity."&lt;SEP&gt;"TMlp, or Tenebrio molitor larvae powder, is a product prepared from Tenebrio molitor larvae, used for its potential biological effects."</data>
