    <node id="&quot;MTT ASSAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MTT assay is a biochemical measure used to assess cell viability."&lt;SEP&gt;"MTT assay is a biological process used to assess cell viability and proliferation in experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MTT assay is a biological process used to evaluate the effects of TMlp extract on MCF-7 cell viability."&lt;SEP&gt;"MTT assay is a method used to measure cell viability and cytotoxicity, which is being used to study the effects of mealworm and superworm extracts."&lt;SEP&gt;"MTT assay is a method used to measure cell viability and cytotoxicity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MTT assay is a biochemical measure used to assess cell growth and cytotoxicity."</data>
