    <node id="&quot;STUDENT'S T-TEST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICAL METHOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Student's t-test is a biological process used for statistical analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical concept used to compare the means of two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical method used to evaluate the significance of the results in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical test used to compare the means of two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical test used to compare means of two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical process used to compare the means of two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical method used to compare means between two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical method being used to compare the differences between diets and species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical method used to analyze the data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Student's t-test is a statistical method used to compare the means of two groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's t-test is a statistical method used to assess the significant differences in the extraction rates, plastic removal, and Mw, Mp, and Ms values."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99a98d885ec6495c4dc902866c4ab9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb1740bb657b0f90c48ee5e6d75945ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf6d17dfbab29bcb302ae97679bc903&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3380732c060363504db5f6e4b8610b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dce72fccb3df94ec407aba3d4df8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1</data>
    </node>
