    <node id="&quot;MCV&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MCV, or mean corpuscular volume, is the average size of red blood cells, with a measured value of 52.72±0.28 fL."</data>
