    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HERMETIA ILLUCENS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hermetia illucens is a species of black soldier fly that can biodegrade polyethylene and polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens is a species of fly that has been studied for its nutritional value as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens, also known as the black soldier fly, is a species of insect that is being studied for its potential use as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens, also known as the black soldier fly, is a species of fly larvae that can be used for entomoremediation, a novel in-situ bioremediation approach."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens is the scientific name for the Black Soldier Fly (BSF), a well-studied insect species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens, also known as the black soldier fly, is a genus of insect that can be reared on organic waste streams."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hermetia illucens is a species of black soldier fly that is used as a source of nutrient composition and is also capable of biodegrading polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-915331bc1ae85fe139629eaebc4042cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d40b7debb6497167fa1aec874ebce45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMARKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biomarker is a concept related to the detection of biological processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biomarker refers to a molecule or other indicator that can be used to measure biological processes, such as biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biomarkers are biological molecules that can be used to measure the presence or progression of a disease or condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biomarker is a measurable indicator of the presence or extent of a biological process, such as biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf2753a9a78b282c1ca2c0539e3203d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-383865d9c2a2b8a7cabd754f1193b8f3</data>
    </node>
