      <data key="d1">"Environmental health is affected by the accumulation of plastic waste, including polystyrene, in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental health refers to the impact of environmental factors on human health, and can be influenced by factors such as pollution and climate change."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2a00d67f63d22d1959c8a565b6a86d22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de</data>
