      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Entomophagy is the practice of eating insects, which is being considered as a potential use for insects that degrade Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entomophagy refers to the practice of consuming insects as a food source, with potential benefits including high nutritional value, low environmental impact, and increased food security."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entomophagy refers to the practice of eating insects."</data>
