    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental impact is a concept that is being studied in the research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental impact refers to the effects of human activities on the environment, with implications for the potential of insect-based food products to reduce environmental impact and promote sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental impact refers to the effects that human activities have on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental impact refers to the potential harm that human activities can cause to the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental impact refers to the effects that human activities, such as plastic pollution, have on the environment."</data>
