      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Exiguobacterium is a genus of bacteria that includes species capable of degrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exiguobacterium is a genus of bacteria that is capable of degrading PS, and was found to be the main responsible for the degradation of PS in a previous study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Exiguobacterium is a genus of bacteria that includes strains with potential for PS biodegradation."</data>
