      <data key="d1">"Riboflavin is a nutrient that is important for the growth and survival of mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PANTOTHENIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pantothenic acid is a nutrient that is important for the growth and survival of mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TROPHIC TRANSFER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trophic transfer is the process by which microplastics are transferred through the food chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trophic transfer refers to the biological process that describes the transfer of microplastics from one organism to another through the food chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trophic transfer refers to the process by which microplastics and nanoplastics are transferred from one organism to another through the food chain."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0</data>
    </node>
