      <data key="d2">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"POP refers to a type of toxin that can accumulate along with microplastics in the environment and cause harm to human health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pop is a researcher who has studied the metagenomic analysis of the human distal gut microbiome."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827853316f7304c444884dc82f757802</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOD CHAIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Food chain is an ecological concept that describes the transfer of energy and nutrients from one organism to another."&lt;SEP&gt;"Food chain refers to the biological concept that describes the transfer of microplastics from one organism to another."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEE MAN CHU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lee Man CHU is a researcher who supervised and contributed to the study on mealworms and microplastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de</data>
    </node>
