      <data key="d1">"Poultry feed is a product that can be made from mealworms and superworms, which are known to be a nutritious food source for poultry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poultry feed is a product that can contain mealworms that have ingested microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poultry feed is a type of food that can be made using superworms and mealworms."</data>
