      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Developmental stages refer to the different life stages of mealworms that can be affected by the ingestion of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Developmental stages refer to the different stages of growth and development that an organism undergoes, including the larval, pupal, and adult stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Developmental stages refer to the different stages of growth and development in an organism's life cycle."</data>
