      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stanford University is a research institution that contributed to the study on PET biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that has conducted research on the biodegradation of plastics by insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization where research on biodegradation of plastics by T. molitor larvae has been conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an academic institution involved in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that provided financial support for the research on biodegradation of polystyrene through the Woods Institute for Environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution where some of the authors are affiliated, and where Professor Craig S. Criddle and Ms. Anja M. Brandon are based."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that has previously tested the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution that conducts research on plastic biodegradation and the role of mealworms and their gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that is being acknowledged for its support during the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that provided support for the research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution where some of the researchers are affiliated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that supported the research on plastic degradation by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is the institution where the study was conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is the institution where Craig S. Criddle is a professor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an educational institution that, through its Woods Institute for Environment, supported research related to environmental issues, potentially including plastic biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that provided financial support for the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is a university that is affiliated with the Woods Institute for Environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an institution where some of the researchers are affiliated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization where Professor Wei-Min Wu is affiliated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stanford University is an organization that has contributed to the research on biodegradation of PS polymers by mealworms."</data>
