    <node id="&quot;CHINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"China is a country that has been studied for its microplastic pollution in wastewater treatment plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where mealworms were sourced from."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where T. molitor larvae have been studied for their ability to biodegrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where the experiment was conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where mealworms were incubated and studied for their ability to consume plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is one of the countries where mealworms have been found to digest polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where mealworms were studied for their ability to degrade polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where mealworms were purchased for the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where the experiment was conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where a research institution is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is the country where the breeding farm and other organizations are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where the research institutions State Key Laboratory of Urban Water Resource and Environment, School of Environment, Harbin Institute of Technology, and College of Wildlife and Protected Area, Northeast Forestry University are based."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where research on biodegradation of polymers by mealworms has been conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where T. obscurus larvae were purchased."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where Tenebrio molitor and Tenebrio obscurus larvae were collected."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where Guanyuan Insects Breeding Plant, Luoyang Insects Breeding Plant, and Lan Tian Plastic Company are based."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where the insect farms and breeding farms are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a location where the insect-breeding plants are located."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where the yellow mealworm farm and other locations are situated."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where research was conducted and funded."&lt;SEP&gt;"China is a country where the study on mealworms and microplastics was conducted and where a significant amount of plastic production and waste occurs."</data>
