    <node id="&quot;METABOLOME ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metabolome analysis is a biological process involved in the analysis of the metabolome of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metabolome analysis is a biological process that involves the comprehensive study of the metabolites present in a biological system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metabolome analysis is a technique used to study the metabolic processes of the T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metabolome analysis is the study of the complete set of metabolites present in a biological system."</data>
