      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Facultative bacteria are a type of microorganism that contributes to PET degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Facultative bacteria refer to microorganisms that can live in both aerobic and anaerobic conditions, such as Enterobacter spp."</data>
