      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anaerobic bacteria are a type of microorganism that contributes to PET degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anaerobic bacteria refer to microorganisms that can only live in the absence of oxygen, such as Clostridium and Spiroplasma."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2b715dc0bf578795b387fe1255d07f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14</data>
