      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Synthetic polymers are a type of material made from human-made substances, including plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic polymers are the materials that are biodegraded by insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic polymers are man-made materials that can be broken down by enzymes, as studied by Chen, C.-C. and co-authors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic polymers are human-made materials that can be used in a variety of applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic polymers refer to human-made materials like polystyrene, which are being studied for their degradation by microorganisms."</data>
