    <node id="&quot;CRAIG S. CRIDDLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Craig S. Criddle is a person mentioned in the study as a contributor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a person who contributed to the research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a person who is being acknowledged for his support and suggestions during the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a researcher at Stanford University who studies plastic biodegradation and the role of mealworms and their gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of plastics by insect larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a professor at Stanford University who provided suggestions and support for the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a person who provided support and suggestions during the study on polypropylene (PP) biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a researcher affiliated with Stanford University."&lt;SEP&gt;"Craig S. Criddle is a researcher who has provided suggestions for the study on biodegradation of PS polymers by mealworms."</data>
