    <node id="&quot;DNA EXTRACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DNA extraction is a biological process performed on the microflora collected from the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is a process used to extract DNA from gut microflora of T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is a process used to obtain DNA from microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is the process of isolating DNA from the larvae, used to analyze the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is a process used to extract DNA from microorganisms for research purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is the process of isolating DNA from cells or tissues, which is a crucial step in many molecular biology techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"DNA extraction is a biological process used to extract DNA from the larvae."</data>
