    <node id="&quot;USA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The USA is one of the countries where mealworms have been found to digest polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"USA is a country where mealworms were sourced from."&lt;SEP&gt;"USA is a location where T. molitor larvae have been studied for their ability to biodegrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"USA is a location where mealworms were found to consume plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"USA is a location where the research institution Department of Civil and Environmental Engineering, William &amp; Mary Cogdill Resource Recovery Center, Stanford University is based."&lt;SEP&gt;"USA is a country where Thermo Fisher Scientific is situated."</data>
