      <data key="d0">"FAMILY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Darkling beetles are a genus of beetles that includes the yellow mealworm beetle, whose larvae are known to consume plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Darkling beetles are a type of insect that has been found to have plastic-degrading microorganisms in their gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Darkling beetles, family Tenebrionidae, are known to chew and eat plastic packaging materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Darkling beetles, belonging to the family Tenebrionidae, are a group of insects studied for their ability to biodegrade plastics."</data>
