      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DSC is a technique used to assess the thermal properties of the polystyrene samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) is a method used to assess the thermal properties of materials and investigate biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"DSC is an analytical technique used to study the thermal properties of materials, such as polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Differential Scanning Calorimetry (DSC) is a process used to confirm the nature of the polystyrene."</data>
