    <node id="&quot;STARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Starch is a nutrient added to the PE-oxo diet, making up approximately 1% of its composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a nutrient component of the barley bran, making up 22.0% of its composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a type of nutrient that can be used as a co-diet in biodegradation studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a nutrient that is a component of the PE plastic film used in this study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a nutrient that is metabolized by Mealworm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a nutrient found in the barley."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a type of nutrient that can be added to the feed of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a type of carbohydrate that can be used to produce biodegradable plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a type of nutrient that can be used to improve the biodegradability of polypropylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starch is a nutrient that is beneficial for the growth and development of T. molitor."</data>
