      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nuclear Magnetic Resonance (NMR) is a technique used to characterize the changes in the end groups of polystyrene (PS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of plastic polymers."</data>
