    <node id="&quot;JELLY POWDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jelly powder is a nutrient used as an adhesive to mix with polystyrene microplastics (MPs) and wheat bran to create a diet for the larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5540fc6fe4d3ef0fd986ec36a589c77f</data>
