      <data key="d1">"TGA is a technique used to analyze the thermal properties of polyurethane foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermal Gravimetric Analysis (TGA) is a technique used to characterize the thermal changes of polystyrene (PS)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermal gravimetric analysis (TGA) is a biochemical measure used to analyze the thermal properties of fecula."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermal gravimetric analysis (TGA) is a method used to analyze the thermal stability of plastic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermal gravimetric analysis (TGA) is a method used to characterize the thermal changes during the conversion of PS to frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thermal gravimetric analysis (TGA) is a technique used to study the thermal decomposition of PP foam and frass samples."</data>
