    <node id="&quot;HYDROGEN BOND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL BOND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hydrogen bond is a type of chemical bond that can occur between molecules, such as those present in frass samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrogen bond is a type of chemical bond that is associated with the hydroxyl groups and/or carboxylic acid groups in the FTIR spectra of PS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrogen bond is a type of chemical bond that is formed between molecules, which can influence the degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrogen bond is a type of chemical bond that is formed during the biodegradation of LDPE, as shown by the FTIR spectra."</data>
