    <node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maintenance is a biological process that occurs in organisms as they maintain their current state and repair damaged tissues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance is a physiological response of mealworms to the consumption of plastics and nutrients, which provides them with the energy they need to survive."</data>
