      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T-test is a statistical method that is being used to analyze the differences in mass loss in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"T-test is a statistical test used to compare the molecular weights of PS before and after degradation by mealworms."</data>
