      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nitrogen content is a measure of the amount of nitrogen present in a substance, which is decreased in the frass of polystyrene-fed insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen content is a nutrient that is affected by the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS) by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nitrogen content refers to the amount of nitrogen in the biomass and frass of mealworms, varying amongst different treatments."</data>
