    <node id="&quot;DIET 1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diet 1 is a diet that consists of a specific ratio of bran to PS polymer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet with a high bran:PS ratio, which supports a better gut microbiome and higher PS consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet with a lower amount of bran, which may affect the growth of specific microbial species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a specific diet used in the experiment, with a bran:PS ratio of 4:1 w/w."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet that is used in the study to investigate its effects on mealworms' metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet used in the experiment to study the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a specific diet fed to Tenebrio molitor larvae, resulting in higher consumption of PS and higher amount of degrading compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a type of diet used in the experiment, with a low PS:bran ratio."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet used in the experiment, consisting of a mixture of barley and polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet with a 4:1 bran:PS ratio, which affects the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 1 is a diet with a bran-to-PS ratio of 4:1, with its effects on PS degradation compared to other diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30c4244cae75095bda7fb526c3d0c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9904e6f38706256e15c7957f8f0527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e415042ae4079ee5fe96c7105eb534c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3eb3742a8be739a1146cbf15e6b7ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2122660fcfebecf752000198a16f222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395b01f15fd97b70e2368941120e9a37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIET 2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diet 2 is a diet that consists of a specific ratio of bran to PS polymer and includes water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet with a high bran:PS ratio and water, which facilitates better PS consumption and higher survival rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet with a higher bran:PS ratio and the presence of H2O, which may affect the growth of specific microbial species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a specific diet used in the experiment, with a bran:PS ratio of 20:1 w/w and added water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet that is used in the study to investigate its effects on mealworms' metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet used in the experiment to study the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a specific diet fed to Tenebrio molitor larvae, resulting in different effects on biodegradation compared to Diet 1."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a type of diet used in the experiment, with a high PS:bran ratio and water included."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet used in the experiment, consisting of a mixture of barley and polystyrene with hydration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet with a 20:1 bran:PS ratio and includes H2O, which affects the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 2 is a diet with a bran-to-PS ratio of 20:1 and the presence of water, with its effects on PS degradation compared to other diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30c4244cae75095bda7fb526c3d0c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84f576487c8d473c1524eb1141730a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9904e6f38706256e15c7957f8f0527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e415042ae4079ee5fe96c7105eb534c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3eb3742a8be739a1146cbf15e6b7ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2122660fcfebecf752000198a16f222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395b01f15fd97b70e2368941120e9a37</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIET 3&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diet 3 is a diet that consists of a specific ratio of bran to PS polymer without water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet with a high bran:PS ratio, which supports the growth of anaerobic bacteria such as Clostridium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet with a higher bran:PS ratio, which may affect the growth of specific microbial species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a specific diet used in the experiment, with a bran:PS ratio of 20:1 w/w and no added water."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet that is used in the study to investigate its effects on mealworms' metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet used in the experiment to study the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a specific diet fed to Tenebrio molitor larvae, requiring the least handling and resulting in different effects on biodegradation compared to Diet 1."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a type of diet used in the experiment, with a PS:bran ratio of 20:1."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet used in the experiment, consisting of a mixture of barley and polystyrene without hydration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet with a 20:1 bran:PS ratio, which affects the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Diet 3 is a diet with a bran-to-PS ratio of 20:1, with its effects on PS degradation compared to other diets."</data>
