      <data key="d1">"PS consumption is a biological process that is affected by the diet and hydration of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS consumption is a biological process that occurs in insects, with its rate and extent affected by the presence of bran and water."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS consumption is a biological process that refers to the degradation of PS polymer by T. molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS consumption is the process by which the mealworms consume PS foam."</data>
