    <node id="&quot;GC-TOF-MS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNIQUE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GC-TOF-MS is a technique used to analyze the metabolic profiling of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS is a technology used for the analysis of metabolites in the study of polystyrene biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS is a technology used for the quantification of monomers and oligomers in the frass of T. molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS is a type of mass spectrometry that is used for the analysis of substances, including the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS is a type of analytical technique used for metabolic profiling and to investigate the existence of polymer-generated organic residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS is a type of analytical technique used to detect and quantify compounds in the frass of Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS, or gas chromatography-time of flight mass spectrometry, is a technique used to analyze the metabolic profiling of mealworms biodegrading expanded polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS, or gas chromatography-time of flight-mass spectrometry, is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of substances, including the metabolites produced by mealworms during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-TOF-MS, or gas chromatography-time of flight-mass spectrometry, is a technique used to analyze the metabolic profiling of microorganisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5134944e002326fa5ca136c470d99e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e25fe1af3bede4605e7b94d457c9634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779ca6b59945309c6bf5040c9fb474ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56604c68c2f6221f63a4afa5d457e8ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c095cc3175666d5093fe411f9a39cb66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f2fd4b2e978e6745e0dde602114a826</data>
    </node>
