      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gas Chromatography is a technology used for the analysis of substances, including the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography is a biochemical measure used to determine the fatty acid composition of the mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography is a laboratory technique used to analyze the fatty acid profile of a sample."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas chromatography is a technique used to identify the products of bacterial degradation of styrene."</data>
