      <data key="d0">"TECHNIQUE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mass Spectrometry is a technology used for the analysis of substances, including the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mass spectrometry is a type of biochemical measure that is used to analyze the biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mass spectrometry is a type of biochemical measure that has been used to study polyethylene biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mass spectrometry is a technique used to analyze the biodegradation of PS film."</data>
