      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Poly(butylene succinate-co-butylene adipate) is a type of biodegradable plastic that can be broken down by Aspergillus Versicolor, indicating its potential for environmental remediation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poly(butylene succinate-co-butylene adipate) is a type of biodegradable plastic that is environmentally friendly."</data>
