      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hydrocarbon is a chemical compound that can be biodegraded by bacterial hydrocarbon degraders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrocarbon is a chemical property that can be degraded by microorganisms, as discussed in the study by Bardi et al."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrocarbon is a type of chemical compound that can be biodegraded by microorganisms, indicating its potential for environmental remediation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrocarbon is a type of compound that is broken down by alkane 1-monoxygenase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hydrocarbon is a type of chemical compound that is found in PE and other plastics."</data>
