      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Corn flour is a nutrient that was used to feed Tenebrio obscurus larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corn flour is a nutrition-rich codiet that enhances PS consumption by both T. obscurus and T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corn flour is a type of food that provides sufficient nutrients for the growth of T. obscurus larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corn flour is a type of nutrient used as a diet for T. obscurus and T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corn flour is another food additive that was used to increase the utilization of PS by mealworms, with a significant increase in utilization rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Corn flour is used as a feedstock in the experiment."</data>
