      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mitochondrial DNA is a type of DNA that was studied in the context of epigenetic modification caused by PU in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mitochondrial DNA is the genetic material found in the mitochondria of cells, which can be affected by the degradation of polyurethane."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mitochondrial DNA refers to the DNA found in the mitochondria of cells."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d</data>
