      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Epigenetic modification is a biological process that was studied in the context of mealworms' utilization of PU."&lt;SEP&gt;"Epigenetic modification refers to changes in gene expression that do not involve changes to the underlying DNA sequence, which can be caused by the degradation of polyurethane."&lt;SEP&gt;"Epigenetic modification refers to changes in gene expression that do not involve changes to the underlying DNA sequence."</data>
