    <node id="&quot;PUPAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pupae are a life stage of the lesser waxworms used in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae are the transitional stage of the mealworm beetle, used in the study to degrade polystyrene waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the mealworm insects that do not actively consume plastic, affecting the overall consumption rate of the insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the mealworm, which appears during the biodegradation experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the mealworm, which can affect the efficiency of polyurethane degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the superworms, which emerges into adult beetles within one week."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pupae of Tenebrio molitor are the stage that follows the larval stage and precedes the adult stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pupae is a life stage of the T. molitor insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a stage of development of the yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is the stage of development of the T. molitor species, where the larvae transform into adult beetles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the mealworms used in the experiment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the mealworms, during which they undergo metamorphosis and transform into adult insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of A. grisea larvae that develops after the larval phase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the lesser waxworm (Achroia grisella) that is involved in the development of the insect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of the lesser waxworms that is observed during the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae are the intermediate stages of insects, being collected and reared separately to the adult stage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of Tenebrio molitor, which is affected by the type of feed provided."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of mealworms, with formation and hatching influenced by diet and rearing conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of insects that was not observed during the 36-day test."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a life stage of T. molitor, characterized by transformation into adulthood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is a stage in the life cycle of T. molitor, characterized by transformation into an adult."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-531058c4540bd4e6a50d141db01d4d11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f488d8d4434d57d1a775a22333caa04b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be41a05c5e519995f6622e2258511b70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eecad183fc5700f3d7e0a266e293de1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5af82472112cbc9e76b1fd1ac6e8c54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbedc06292e5cf07fbca1958d8587e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bd8cf0d5102bbca724e0773be0eeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b6629e8c030ab3162553d83aa6eca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838d20fb5f3709d303402ea916d8172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e356bad5f8c2dd9188b38c0d9462b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a97d5b092508f2e837932274d6b3282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c11c77665793ac79aecfb19a89dd1f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25215becbc007a60f24b86a2d6aaf26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed</data>
