    <node id="&quot;SUPERWORM FRASS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Superworm frass is a biological marker produced by superworms, used to support cacti growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Superworm frass is a by-product of superworms that can be used as a medium for plant growth, with superior rooting and growth capabilities compared to mealworm frass."</data>
