    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GC-MS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GC-MS is a biological concept used to analyze the chemical composition of worm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technique used to detect and analyze the chemical composition of superworm frass and mealworm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS, or gas chromatography-mass spectrometry, is a technique being used to analyze the composition of intestinal feces."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technology used for the analysis of metabolites in the study of polystyrene biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a biological concept used to analyze the metabolites produced through the degradation of PS and lignin."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a type of analytical technique that is used to study the metabolism of plants and microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is used to profile the gut and frass samples of PS-, CS-, CB-fed and unfed larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS was used to detect the intermediates of CS and PS metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS refers to gas chromatography-mass spectrometry, a technique used to analyze fatty acid content."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS, or Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry, is a technique used to analyze the chemical composition of materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technology used to analyze the degradation products of the Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technique used to analyze the degradation products of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technology used to further identify the depolymerization products of plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6dce72fccb3df94ec407aba3d4df8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5134944e002326fa5ca136c470d99e2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e155a60beeedb5736450fdc1ffa4699e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39596f0742e3d89f278017df88b8065b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb00229bf45a3bd9b8a17e10a1c93d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20395efa1299dc8b777774e765ad1159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ad3152e855d5b8085e1e61af57515d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e557113f1cfd2472fa9c51d1cdc3069a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af</data>
    </node>
