      <data key="d2">chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GC-MS ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GC-MS analysis is a biochemical measure used to detect and identify chemicals in superworm and mealworm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a technique used to detect and analyze the chemical composition of superworm frass and mealworm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a method used to detect and identify the metabolites produced during PS metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a biological function used to analyze the degradation products of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a biological function used to identify the depolymerization products of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a tool used to analyze the chemical composition of plastic particles."</data>
