      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Heptacosane is a chemical property that can be detected in the frass of mealworms and superworms, and may have growth-promoting effects on plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Heptacosane is a short-chain-growth-promoting alkene semiochemical detected in the GC-MS analysis of superworm frass."</data>
