      <data key="d1">"Nonadecane is a chemical compound that has been identified in the biodegradation of polystyrene by Achromobacter."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonadecane is a chemical property that can be detected in the frass of mealworms and superworms, and may have growth-promoting effects on plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nonadecane is a short-chain-growth-promoting alkene semiochemical detected in the GC-MS analysis of superworm frass."</data>
