    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TCA CYCLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TCA cycle is a biological process involved in the production of metabolic energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCA cycle is a biological process that can be involved in the degradation of styrene, a monomer of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCA cycle, also known as the citric acid cycle or Krebs cycle, is a key process in cellular energy metabolism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a708f09b97ac93da05bd1d20bdfe174&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c4d027474e8769f550ce290c9391ae</data>
