      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Extracellular oxidative enzymes are a type of enzyme that can be released by enteric microorganisms to facilitate EPS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Extracellular oxidative enzymes are enzymes that are secreted by bacteria and play a crucial role in breaking down polystyrene polymer chains."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-652bf0615ec39fba0cedd113ec87a78a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3c4d027474e8769f550ce290c9391ae</data>
