    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECYCLING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Recycling is a conventional method to tackle plastic pollution, but it is not sufficient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling is a process that involves breaking down used materials, such as plastics, into raw materials that can be used to make new products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling is the process of converting waste materials into new products, including plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling is a process that is being used to reduce plastic waste and pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling is the process of converting waste materials into new products or materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling refers to the process of converting waste materials into new products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling is a method of disposing of waste, including plastic waste, that is considered more environmentally friendly than landfill or incineration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling refers to the process of collecting and processing materials, including plastics like polystyrene, to create new products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recycling, specifically of waste plastics like polypropylene (PP), is a process that can be aided by the biodegradation capabilities of microorganisms like T. molitor and Z. atratus."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e540abd667582c77f4d2222836147ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f0582a5d7e55961a1ce4d971d3e4a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41635122b30ee45048cc885b38fff6ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7106a16c81492914e4ba58e248689714</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECOVERY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Recovery is a process that involves retrieving valuable materials, such as plastics, from waste streams."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOURCE REDUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Source reduction is a process that involves reducing the amount of waste generated at the source, such as through the use of biodegradable materials."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIODEGRADABLE MATERIALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biodegradable materials are materials that can be broken down by microorganisms into harmless components."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradable materials, such as PLA, are used in various applications and can be decomposed by microorganisms in the gut of mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc88563632a3abf926bf4e4ac16973fb</data>
