      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pseudomonas fluorescens is a bacterium that is capable of degrading styrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pseudomonas fluorescens is a strain of bacteria capable of growing on styrene as a sole carbon source, indicating its potential role in biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pseudomonas fluorescens is a species of bacteria that is capable of biodegrading polyethylene via complete solubilization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pseudomonas fluorescens is a strain of microorganism capable of styrene catabolism."</data>
