    <node id="&quot;MARINE POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marine pollution is a significant environmental issue, with plastic wastes causing harm to marine animals and ecosystems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marine pollution is the contamination of the ocean and its ecosystems by human activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marine pollution refers to the contamination of the ocean and its inhabitants by human activities, including plastic waste."</data>
