    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WILDLIFE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wildlife can be harmed by plastic pollution, including through entanglement and ingestion of plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wildlife refers to the diverse range of living organisms that can be affected by plastic pollution, including animals and plants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wildlife refers to the animals that live in their natural habitats, and are affected by plastic waste."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896c5c0e4d1805ded38b335876a02f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8076792f39f6c801b538312a7b45fe</data>
    </node>
