      <data key="d1">"Ocean is a location where plastics frequently end up, causing environmental pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ocean is a major ecosystem that can be harmed by plastic pollution, including marine pollution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41635122b30ee45048cc885b38fff6ea</data>
    </node>
