    <node id="&quot;BIODEGRADABLE POLYMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biodegradable polymers are a group of materials that are being studied in the research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradable polymers are a type of material that can break down naturally in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradable polymers are a type of product that can be broken down by microorganisms, reducing environmental impact."</data>
