    <node id="&quot;CHEMICAL REACTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chemical reactions are processes that involve the transformation of one substance into another, including the breakdown of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical reactions are processes that occur in the digestive system of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical reactions refer to the processes by which enzymes break down complex molecules into simpler ones."</data>
