      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Azotobacter beijerinckii is a bacterium that is involved in the degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Azotobacter beijerinckii is a microorganism that produces hydroquinone peroxidase, which can enzymatically degrade polystyrene."</data>
