    <node id="&quot;PEROXIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Peroxidase is a degradative enzyme involved in the oxidation of PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme involved in the cleavage of the aromatic benzene ring of PS and lignin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme involved in the degradation of peroxides and other oxidized compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme involved in the degradation of xenobiotics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme that is involved in the biodegradation of PP polymers, helping to break down the polymer into smaller molecules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme that is involved in the degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme that is involved in the degradation of lignin and other complex organic polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme that is involved in the degradation of PS and is upregulated in LG3 when using Mi-PS as a carbon source."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peroxidase is an enzyme that is involved in the degradation of PS under anaerobic conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-91523cdd8f510a966e9b301a0adb96b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf1f7b81bc271c665d7776cc3114a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a889b716cac361e6e04405777075076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181e2c8b4d78916fefcf87c119f11d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935</data>
