    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Science is a biological concept that encompasses the study of the natural world and the impact of human activities on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science is the field of study that encompasses the research on biodegradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science is the study of the natural world and the impact of human activities on the environment, including the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science is the study of the natural world and the impact of human activities on the environment, including biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Science is a field of study that focuses on the natural world and the impact of human activity on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Science is the field of study that examines the impact of human activity on the environment, including the biodegradation of plastics."</data>
