    <node id="&quot;LINEAR LOW-DENSITY POLYETHYLENE (LLDPE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LLDPE is a type of plastic that is similar to LDPE and is widely used."&lt;SEP&gt;"Linear Low-Density Polyethylene (LLDPE) is a type of plastic that is commonly used in packaging and other applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE) is a type of plastic that is being studied for its biodegradation by various microorganisms."</data>
