      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Potassium bromide (KBr) is a chemical property used to grind frass samples into homogeneous powders for scanning and graphing with FTIR."&lt;SEP&gt;"Potassium bromide (KBr) is a chemical used to prepare frass samples for FTIR analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Potassium bromide (KBr) is a chemical used to prepare the frass samples for FTIR analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Potassium bromide is used in the preparation of homogenous pellets for FTIR analysis."</data>
