    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENG ET AL.&quot;&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Peng et al. are researchers who compared the PS degradation efficiencies of yellow mealworms and dark mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. are researchers who published studies on the biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. are researchers whose previous reports are referenced in the thermogravimetric analysis of the samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. is a group of researchers who have studied the biodegradation of EPS by insects such as Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. are researchers who have published studies related to PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. is a research group that has studied the degradation of plastics by bacteria in mealworm guts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. is a research group that has studied the gut microbiome of insects and its relation to plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. refers to a research study or publication that is cited in the text, providing information on the degradation of PP polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Peng et al. is a researcher or group of researchers who have conducted studies on the biodegradation of plastics."</data>
