      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UPARSE is a software tool for generating highly accurate OTU sequences from microbial amplicon reads."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a software used to cluster sequences and identify operational taxonomic units (OTUs) in the microbiome analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a tool used to cluster Operational Taxonomic Units (OTU) in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a software tool used for analyzing microbial amplicon reads and identifying operational taxonomic units (OTUs)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uparse is a software used for determining operational taxonomic units (OTUs)."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a software used to cluster Operational Taxonomic Units (OTUs) with a 0.97 identity threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"UPARSE is a software used to cluster the Operational Taxonomic Units (OTUs) from the 16S rRNA gene sequences."</data>
