      <data key="d0">"UNIT OF MEASUREMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CFU is a unit of measurement for cell concentration, with 10^9 CFU mL^-1 used in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"CFU is a unit of measurement that represents the number of colony-forming units of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"CFU, or colony-forming units, is a measure of the number of microorganisms in a sample."</data>
