      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio genus is a genus of beetles that includes species such as T. molitor and T. obscurus, which have the ability to depolymerize PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio genus is a group of insects that have been found to be capable of breaking down plastic polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio genus is a group of insects that includes T. molitor and T. obscurus, known for their behavior of cannibalism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio genus is a group of microorganisms that includes T. molitor and T. obscurus."</data>
