      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Broad depolymerization is a type of depolymerization pattern where both the molecular weight and number-average molecular weight of a polymer decrease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Broad depolymerization refers to a pattern of depolymerization where both Mn and Mw decrease simultaneously."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-49ebafd73759fc2bf3d4a642ccad96e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2d6bcd4d2cc81a978694e417e76747e</data>
    </node>
