      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Limited depolymerization is a biological process that occurs during the biodegradation of plastics, with a limited extent of depolymerization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Limited depolymerization is a type of depolymerization pattern where the molecular weight of a polymer increases while the number-average molecular weight decreases."</data>
