    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIGNIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lignin is a biological concept that refers to a type of complex organic material that is degraded by certain microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a biological marker involved in the degradation pathway of PS and lignin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic compound that can be degraded by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a type of nutrient that can be degraded by certain microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a type of nutrient that is broken down by microorganisms in the gut of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic polymer that can be degraded by various enzymes and microorganisms, with significance in biofuel production and biotechnology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a metabolite that can be degraded by enzymes such as laccase, and its degradation is important for the production of biofuels and other value-added products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a natural polymer that can be degraded by certain enzymes and microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a natural polymer that can be degraded by certain insects, including Tenebrio molitor, and their gut microbes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a type of nutritional component found in the feedstocks."&lt;SEP&gt;"lignin is a complex organic polymer that is a key component of plant cell walls, and its degradation is an important process in the metabolism of plants and microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a complex organic molecule that is found in plant cell walls and has been shown to be degraded by T. molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lignin is a type of biological molecule that can be used to improve the biodegradability of polypropylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-85fe36521680f0d09a603eab04706561&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe58fb1bbaa5c35e9c6c837d0b1050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa5755e6c9a5eeae3f595d901dff422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1769c4becf46c99994cb7ced2bffda1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6c2706bd609f920aa61d5ef2310db6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a8c5ce99d234a2ac272a8b4b8135e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db579d338d8f90574e3ac67a3ae9938d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53d382cbd1392dbcf9530428c2eb8584</data>
    </node>
