    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPANDED PS FOAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Expanded PS foam is a specific type of polystyrene foam used in the study, characterized by its thickness and molecular weight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expanded PS foam is a type of plastic material that is being studied for its biodegradation, with a high molecular weight and hydrophobic properties."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e96b716e9400e9e77e099de5cca7c548</data>
    </node>
