    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECRETED FACTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Secreted factors are substances produced by the mealworm and its gut bacteria, potentially involved in plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e96b716e9400e9e77e099de5cca7c548</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STARVATION PERIOD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSIOLOGICAL RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A starvation period is a condition applied to the mealworms to ensure removal of antibiotic residuals, indicating a specific life stage or treatment condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Starvation period refers to the duration of time an organism, such as a mealworm, goes without food, which can affect its physiological responses and energy reserves."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc88563632a3abf926bf4e4ac16973fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e96b716e9400e9e77e099de5cca7c548</data>
