      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bushnell Haas (BH) media is a type of nutrient-rich media used to culture the PS-degrading bacteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc75b7e672a7f7c036713dfa2675d79a</data>
    </node>
