      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carbon-free Bushnell Haas (BH) media is a type of nutrient-rich media used to culture the PS-degrading bacteria, with the carbon source being the PS film."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc75b7e672a7f7c036713dfa2675d79a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PS FILM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PS film is a chemical substance that is being degraded by the bacterial isolates."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a product that is used as a medium for the growth of microorganisms and the degradation of NPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of material used in the experiments, with its weight loss measured."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of material used in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of plastic material used to study the degradation of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PS film is a type of plastic material used as a carbon source for the PS-degrading bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of polystyrene that has been studied for its biodegradation, particularly in the context of environmental cleanup efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a material prepared from EPS for microbial degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of plastic film that is degraded by the bacterial strains WJ2020 and WJ2025."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a product that is used as a carbon source for microorganisms and is subject to biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film is a type of polystyrene that is being used in experiments to study its degradation by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS film refers to a type of plastic film that is used as a carbon source in the biodegradation assay."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fe29ef34ad1e5ab11c4ec7f5270fa94d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345c72af5aa26d5c4e06d7df5d8a1c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9fcb421212175a148a0a1858582cfb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bdcf1b4859e82ab15050837ab539dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01bf9080cbf55e62c0b26d0e054bd1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c808bc1867233246c6ad41186de9452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10004ab6a85cecf4effb74c306df57cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70735757eafccc0f762f21f5d3ac8556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc75b7e672a7f7c036713dfa2675d79a</data>
    </node>
