      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbial Enrichment refers to the process of selecting for microorganisms that are capable of degrading plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial enrichment is a biological process used to isolate and culture the PS-degrading bacteria from the gut microbiome of mealworms."</data>
