    <node id="&quot;CO2 PRODUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CO2 Production is a measure of the degradation of plastic by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 Production is a measure of the degradation of plastic by the mealworm gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 production is a biochemical measure used to assess the respiration of the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 production is a metabolic measure used to assess the activity of the PS-degrading bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 production is the process by which bacteria produce carbon dioxide as a byproduct of respiration."&lt;SEP&gt;"CO2 production is a metabolic measure of the amount of carbon dioxide produced by the digestion of LDPE by T. molitor and T. obscurus."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d99a98d885ec6495c4dc902866c4ab9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668212da3bf356132cadb63df6ce09b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b95a108327e39d37d20bdd99db541164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eba752cb179633f5dd054ee7c9ee2cba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc75b7e672a7f7c036713dfa2675d79a</data>
    </node>
