      <data key="d1">"Microbial Respiration is the process by which microorganisms break down plastic and produce CO2."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial respiration is a process by which microorganisms break down organic matter, including plastics, and produce carbon dioxide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial respiration is the process by which microorganisms break down organic substances, including PS, and release carbon dioxide and other products."</data>
