    <node id="&quot;PROTEINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROTEIN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Proteins are a component of the bran diet fed to mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a group of nutrients that are essential for the growth and development of the mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a type of nutrient that is being analyzed in the mealworms, with varying levels found in different groups fed with different types of polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a type of nutrient that is necessary for the growth of mealworms, and are lacking in Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are molecules that undergo glycosylation, a process that is crucial for their function and structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a type of nutrient that is being studied for its effects on the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are discussed in terms of their ratio to carbohydrates in the diet of mealworms and their impact on lifespan and reproductive output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a type of nutrient that can be added to the feed of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are a type of nutrient that is essential for the growth and development of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are an important component of mealworms' diet, and their synthesis requires nitrogen, which is fixed by gut bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Proteins are proteins that can be digested by mealworms and affect their metabolic pathways."</data>
