      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sugars are a type of biomolecule that is affected by the type of polystyrene mealworms consume, with decreased levels indicating potential starvation and increased use of carbohydrates for energy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sugars are a type of nutrient being measured in the bodies of mealworms fed different materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sugars are a type of nutrient that is being analyzed in the mealworms, with lower levels found in groups fed with polystyrene compared to the control group."</data>
