    <node id="&quot;ENERGY RECOVERY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Energy recovery is a conventional method to tackle plastic pollution, but it is not sufficient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Energy recovery is a process that is being used to reduce plastic waste and pollution."</data>
