      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biodegradable activity refers to the ability of microorganisms to break down organic materials, in this case, plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradable activity refers to the process by which microorganisms break down plastics, and it has been proven many times."</data>
