      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Landfill is a location where plastics frequently end up, contributing to environmental pollution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Landfill is a location where waste, including polyethylene mulching films, is disposed of."&lt;SEP&gt;"Landfill is a method of disposing of waste, including plastic waste, but it can lead to environmental pollution."</data>
