    <node id="&quot;MFR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MFR (Melt Flow Rate) is a measure of the flow rate of plastics, such as PS, PSr, PSp, and EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"MFR, or melt flow rate, is a measure of the flowability of a polymer, with higher values indicating higher flowability."</data>
