    <node id="&quot;MALNUTRITION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSIOLOGICAL RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Malnutrition is a physiological response observed in the mealworms, particularly in the starved group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Malnutrition is a physiological response that affects the energy source in insects, leading to the oxidation of fatty acids."&lt;SEP&gt;"Malnutrition refers to a state of poor nutrition, which can occur when an organism is not receiving sufficient nutrients to maintain optimal health and functioning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Malnutrition is mentioned as a potential issue for mealworms with inadequate diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14f9f0280098bb86719394a4bd53e5bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2f11b2dff6f9e39c409f2bbd26c9d9</data>
    </node>
