      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gluconeogenesis is a biological process analyzed in the study, with mealworms using it to convert proteins to glucose."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gluconeogenesis is a biological process that converts hydrolyzed proteins to glucose during food deprivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gluconeogenesis is a biological process that is involved in the synthesis of glucose from non-carbohydrate sources."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b0491f3e96c1d355b8431b9d74868f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14f9f0280098bb86719394a4bd53e5bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d290a6a81802d3048c35d2a2fb1252c4</data>
    </node>
