      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metagenome is a genetic concept that refers to the collective genome of the gut microbiome of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metagenome of Tenebrio molitor is being studied to understand the microbial community involved in the degradation of PVC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metagenome refers to the collection of genetic material from a community of microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metagenome refers to the complete set of genetic material produced by the microorganisms that live in a particular environment, such as the gut of Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
