    <node id="&quot;WANG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wang is a researcher who co-authored a study on the diet preference of zebrafish for bio-based polyactic acid microplastics and induced intestinal damage and microbiota dysbiosis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who co-authored a study on the effect of biodegrading polystyrene, polystyrene, and polylvinyl chloride on the growth and development of yellow mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who co-authored a study on the roles of a mitochondrial AccSC02 gene from Apis cerana cerana in oxidative stress responses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who developed the Naive Bayesian classifier."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who has published studies on investigation of gut-associated bacteria in Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of polystyrene by superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who published a study on the gut-associated bacteria in Tenebrio molitor larvae using culture-dependent and DGGE methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who studied the biodegradation of polystyrene wastes in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who has studied the biodegradation of polystyrene wastes in yellow mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who has studied the polar isotactic and syndiotactic polypropylenes by organozirconium-catalyzed masking reagent-free propylene and amino–olefin copolymerization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who found that oxidation reaction on the surface of polymers emerges more oxygen-containing groups and studied the biodegradation of MPs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wang is a researcher who published a study on the impact of mixture effects between emerging organic contaminants on cytotoxicity."</data>
