      <data key="d1">"Aquabacterium is a genus of bacteria that is enriched in the gut microbiome of mealworms fed with PVC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aquabacterium is a genus of microorganisms that can degrade liquid and solid alkanes, quinoline, and indole, and can dechlorinate trichloroethylene under anaerobic conditions."</data>
