    <node id="&quot;PE DEGRADATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE degradation is a biological process by which the lesser waxworm breaks down polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE degradation is a biological process that occurs when lesser waxworms break down polyethylene (PE) into smaller components."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE degradation is a biological process where lesser waxworms break down PE film."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE degradation is the process by which bacteria break down PE into smaller components, which can be utilized for growth."</data>
