      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LB agar plates are a medium used for purifying the bacterial isolates."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB agar plates are a type of medium used to culture bacteria, which can support the growth of PE-degrading bacterial strains."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB agar plates are prepared by adding 15 g/L of agar to the Luria-Bertani (LB) medium, used as a growth medium."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-af682f78e3e8970d7d70b027a8f79116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3235cc6102d988875f1dda974a56038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc</data>
