      <data key="d2">chunk-70735757eafccc0f762f21f5d3ac8556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af682f78e3e8970d7d70b027a8f79116</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SDS is a chemical used in the process of separating polystyrene fragments from contaminating materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"SDS is a detergent used to wash and clean PE mulching film, which can help to remove impurities and contaminants."&lt;SEP&gt;"SDS, or sodium dodecyl sulfate, is a chemical used for washing and cleaning the samples."</data>
