      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Weight loss of PE mulching film is a measure of the amount of PE that has been degraded by bacteria, which can be used to assess their ability to break down PE."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-af682f78e3e8970d7d70b027a8f79116</data>
