      <data key="d1">"Ecological impact refers to the effect of a material or process on the environment, in this case, the ecological impact of PE mulching films."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ecological impact refers to the effects of human activities, such as plastic pollution, on the environment and ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-78830eb6f2457838fda4728b21c17bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee541583aebc7a78ac49285860e4da0</data>
