      <data key="d1">"Bacillus licheniformis is a bacterium that has been used to produce bio-surfactants for the biodegradation of polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus licheniformis is a species of bacteria that produces biosurfactants that can aid in the biodegradation of polyethylene."</data>
