      <data key="d1">"Poly styrene is a type of plastic that has been found to be biodegradable by certain insects, such as Tenebrio molitor and Galliera mellonella."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poly styrene is a type of plastic that is being studied for its biodegradation by various microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Poly styrene is a type of plastic that was used to study the gut microbiota of Alphitobius diaperinus."</data>
