      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL FEATURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sewage sludge is a physical characteristic of wastewater treatment facilities, with its treatment and management being relevant to the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge is a type of location where microorganisms are found and are capable of degrading organic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge is a type of waste material that is being studied for its potential to harbor microplastics and other pollutants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge is a type of waste material that can be treated using hyperthermophilic composting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sewage sludge is a physical environment where microplastics can be found and can affect the physiology and behavior of organisms that live in it."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e6d515521d6d2b72e82154cc544d26cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b68a8917166a3e45f4bf51e2e04949f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d642e5476221b3ea202c68d7e6070b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fb2c1ef38dbbafa838f87d5f4d6fd6a</data>
