      <data key="d1">"Stenotrophomonas sp. is a species of bacteria that is capable of degrading PS, and was found to form tunnels, cracks, and cellular aggregates on PS sheets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stenotrophomonas sp. is a type of microorganism that is capable of biodegrading polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a53fba6106c000acc0dac3484d37a4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2665d67f816d2da20a065d708c370210</data>
