      <data key="d1">"Soil invertebrates are organisms that have been shown to have the ability to biologically degrade plastics, including EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil invertebrates, such as earthworms and isopods, are organisms that live in soil and are capable of degrading organic materials."</data>
