    <node id="&quot;VITAMINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vitamins are a type of nutrient that can be added to the feed of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are a type of nutrient that is necessary for the growth of mealworms, and are lacking in Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are a type of nutrient that is synthesized by microorganisms and is important for the growth and development of insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are nutrients that are not present in plastics, and their absence can impact the health and survival of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are nutrients that may be produced by fungi in the gut of A. diaperinus, which may be related to their ability to degrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are a type of nutrient that is being used as a supplement to enhance the survival and growth of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vitamins are nutrients that are beneficial for the growth and development of T. molitor."</data>
