    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STYROFOAM DEGRADATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Styrofoam degradation is a biological process that occurs in the gut of mealworms, and is facilitated by the gut microbiota."</data>
