      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Protein glycosylation is a biological process that can be affected by the ingestion of PS polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Protein glycosylation is a process by which proteins are modified with sugars, including mannose."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2ee6535da22915c7094098e016b19d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d616d4c3c3199d53c1ae93ebcf3589d</data>
