      <data key="d1">"Stenotrophomonas is a genus of bacteria found in the digestive tracts of T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stenotrophomonas is a type of bacteria found in the gut microbiome of the Tenebrio species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stenotrophomonas is a genus of bacteria that was found to have a significant difference in relative abundance between the bran and PE diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stenotrophomonas is a genus of bacteria that can degrade certain polymers."</data>
