      <data key="d1">"Bacillus anthracis is a bacterium that forms tunnels, cracks, and cellular aggregates on PS sheets, indicating its ability to transform polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacillus anthracis is a species of bacteria that is capable of degrading PS, and was found to form tunnels, cracks, and cellular aggregates on PS sheets."</data>
