      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio molitor adults are the mature stage of the mealworm, which may not be able to digest polystyrene due to changes in their jaw structure and intestinal microbiota."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAW STRUCTURE&quot;">
