      <data key="d2">chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEM-ASSISTED WORKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SEM-assisted works refer to the use of scanning electron microscopy (SEM) to study the degradation of materials, such as polystyrene, by microorganisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACTERIAL-DRIVEN TRANSFORMATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacterial-driven transformations refer to the changes that occur in materials, such as polystyrene, due to the activity of microorganisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da</data>
    </node>
