      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oxo-degradable polyethylene is a type of plastic that can be consumed and digested by mealworms, with potential applications in waste management and bioconversion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oxo-degradable polyethylene is a type of polyethylene that is designed to degrade more easily, but its degradation in the insect's digestive system may produce toxic forms of the polymer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oxo-degradable polyethylene is a type of product used as a diet for insects, with a distinct effect on the insects' development and mortality."</data>
