    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CEL VARIANT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CEL variant is a diet that leads to a switch from glucose metabolism to adipic acid consumption and urease production."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CEL variant is a diet made from cardboard, impacting the development and metamorphosis of Tenebrio molitor."</data>
