      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Palmitoleic acid is a type of compound found in the diet and frass of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitoleic acid is a type of fatty acid found in the insects, with a higher percentage in the OAT diet compared to other variants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitoleic acid is a type of fatty acid found in the larvae, with its content being measured and compared across different feeds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitoleic acid is a type of fatty acid with a content in percentage units, usually determined by authors and measured results below 1%."&lt;SEP&gt;"Palmitoleic acid is a type of fatty acid with the chemical formula C16:1, contributing to the overall fatty acid content."</data>
