      <data key="d1">"Nitrogen metabolism is a biological process that allows microorganisms to metabolize nitrogen-containing compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen metabolism is a biological process that involves the breakdown and synthesis of nitrogen-containing molecules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen metabolism is a biological process that is involved in the degradation of PET and is important for the synthesis of amino acids and other nutrients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen metabolism is a biological process that is involved in the biodegradation of polyethylene."</data>
