    <node id="&quot;GRAPHENE OXIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Graphene oxide is a chemical compound that is being studied in the research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a type of material mentioned as being biodegradable by the larvae of T. molitor and Z. atratus."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a type of material that can be degraded by certain microorganisms or enzymes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a type of material that is mentioned as a material that Tenebrio molitor can degrade."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a type of material that has been found to be biodegradable by certain insects, such as Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a type of material that is being studied for its biodegradation and effects on various organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Graphene oxide is a chemical property used for ultraviolet spectrum conversion."</data>
