    <node id="&quot;ULOMA SP.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Uloma sp. are insects that have the ability to digest and biodegrade plastic products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a species of beetle that is capable of biodegrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a species of insect that is mentioned as a comparison to Tenebrio molitor in terms of biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a species of insect larvae that has been found to biodegrade plastics, specifically PE and PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a species of insect that is capable of biodegrading polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a species of darkling beetle that is capable of biodegrading polyethylene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uloma sp. is a type of insect larvae with similar plastic-degrading features to mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-566afea8a2a89bd188f68d0afa1bb173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3745cb01a4209e2eae28914dde3b52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30a7209d626a6319ba5600bea7f27299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47e7fe379fcd6b17740bc4d953cd3b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-694aaaa7c2839ea048d46b6a2bb13748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0881f766e34a5d97ee711cd2edd793f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGESTIVE ENZYMES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Digestive enzymes are biological molecules that break down food into smaller components."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digestive enzymes in the gut of Tenebrio molitor larvae are responsible for biodegrading petroleum-based plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digestive enzymes of A. grisea larvae may play a role in the biodegradation of PE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digestive enzymes are enzymes that are produced by mealworms to break down food sources, including microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digestive enzymes are produced by mealworm larvae to break down their food, and their production is affected by the type of plastic ingested."&lt;SEP&gt;"Digestive enzymes in Tenebrio molitor larvae are involved in the biodegradation of microplastics, including PE, PS, and PVC."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-566afea8a2a89bd188f68d0afa1bb173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-104d99248e84b2776ff5ca17c285a7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a27dff473ed210517e6461ad3e5d783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bd8cf0d5102bbca724e0773be0eeae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a9d70651c9f13362e4c1e3ce10eab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f</data>
    </node>
