      <data key="d1">"Pediococcus sp. is a genus of bacteria that may be involved in high MW PP degradation in T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pediococcus sp. is a genus of microorganisms that is associated with the production of organic acids from water-soluble carbohydrates during the fermentation of whole-plant corn silage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c310f4f7adc3c5b8340e973a5af45e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0817d79fa27f2f5b078e09086250c6e0</data>
