    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KEYSTONE SPECIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Keystone species are microorganisms that play a crucial role in the degradation of PP in the gut of T. molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9c310f4f7adc3c5b8340e973a5af45e0</data>
