    <node id="&quot;GUT METABOLOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut metabolome refers to the complete set of metabolites present in the gut of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The gut metabolome refers to the set of metabolic products produced by the gut microbiome of insects, such as Tenebrio molitor."</data>
