      <data key="d1">"Purine metabolism is a biological process that is involved in the breakdown and synthesis of purines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purine metabolism is a biological process that is mentioned in the text as a pathway."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purine metabolism is a biological process that is strongly expressed in Black Soldier Fly larvae when exposed to certain plastics such as Polyethylene (PE), Polystyrene (PS), and Polypropylene (PP)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purine metabolism is a metabolic pathway involved in the generation of substrates for basic cellular processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purine metabolism is a metabolic pathway that is upregulated in Mealworm."</data>
