      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut digestive enzymes are biological markers that are involved in the biodegradation of plastics by insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut digestive enzymes are enzymes that are produced in the gut and play a role in digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut digestive enzymes are enzymes that play a role in the digestion of food in the gut of an organism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut digestive enzymes refer to the enzymes found in the gut of an organism that play a role in the digestion and biodegradation of materials, including plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut digestive enzymes are enzymes that are produced in the gut of an organism and are involved in the breakdown of nutrients."</data>
