    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AMINO ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cys refers to cysteine, an amino acid determined in the larval biomass using a Cys assay kit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cys, or cysteine, is an amino acid that is found in high levels in Tenebrio obscurus."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830</data>
