      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Formaldehyde is a chemical that is commonly used to control microbial growth in insect diets, but has been shown to have negative effects on mealworm productivity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formaldehyde is used as a fixative to preserve the larvae for microscopic examination."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830</data>
