    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PE POLYMERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"POLYMER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE polymers are a type of plastic that is biodegraded by T. molitor and T. obscurus larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE polymers, including LDPE, HDPE, and LLDPE, are used in the study to examine their effects on the gut microbial community of Tenebrio species."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE polymers are the subject of the study, focusing on their depolymerization in frass."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f23046f647dab4d4caebd663db9aecde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4d84d6de496440fcabc6616d1c96ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6afbb58ebe9108893daf7e65d59fac39</data>
