    <node id="&quot;KETONES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ketones are a type of chemical property formed during the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ketones are a type of functional group that forms during the biodegradation of PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ketones are a type of toxic compound that can be found in polyethylene, posing health and environmental hazards."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bd4d84d6de496440fcabc6616d1c96ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd104d06a1ede06701ecfa96bccc2c4</data>
    </node>
