    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPECIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Species is a factor that affects the biodegradation of PE polymers by T. molitor and T. obscurus larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Species is a taxonomic rank that is used to classify living organisms, such as the species Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Species refers to a group of living organisms that share common characteristics, such as Tenebrio obscurus."</data>
