    </node>
    <node id="&quot;T. OBSCURUS LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T. obscurus larvae are a species of insects that can depolymerize LDPE, with the process being gut-microbe independent."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. obscurus larvae are a type of microorganism used to study biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. obscurus larvae are the larvae of the T. obscurus species that are used to test the consumption and biodegradation of LDPE."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-639bb2429f20c4fe3994c4a0d15f3295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-843d5746868067bce1a2f15dfc1571e2</data>
