    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M_W&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"M_w is a biochemical measure used to determine the weighted average molecular weight of fecula."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_w is a measure of the weight-average molecular weight of a polymer chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_w, or weight-average molecular weight, is a measure of the molecular weight of polyethylene microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_w is a type of biochemical measure that is being used to analyze the degradation of PS, representing the weight-average molecular weight of the PS residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_w is a measure of the weight-average molecular weight of a polymer, used to characterize the depolymerization of PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_w is a measure of the molecular weight of a polymer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0638e0fe93dc27e678672a164e6088c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe58fb1bbaa5c35e9c6c837d0b1050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-260d8c268067de32e5ac98d66ab70a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988ef111808996ddbe6e483d6505ab45</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;M_N&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"M_n is a biochemical measure used to determine the average molecular weight of fecula."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_n is a measure of the number-average molecular weight of a polymer chain."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_n, or number-average molecular weight, is a measure of the molecular weight of polyethylene microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_n is a type of biochemical measure that is being used to analyze the degradation of PS, representing the number-average molecular weight of the PS residues."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_n is a measure of the number-average molecular weight of a polymer, used to characterize the depolymerization of PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"M_n is a measure of the molecular weight of a polymer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0638e0fe93dc27e678672a164e6088c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe58fb1bbaa5c35e9c6c837d0b1050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-260d8c268067de32e5ac98d66ab70a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988ef111808996ddbe6e483d6505ab45</data>
    </node>
