      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vitamin B6 metabolism is a biological process that is downregulated in Black Soldier Fly larvae when exposed to all plastics, but elevated in Wax Moth larvae when exposed to certain plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b</data>
    </node>
