      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metabolic process is a biological process that occurs within insects, including the Black Soldier Fly (BSF), Mealworm (MW), and Greater Wax Moth (WM)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a</data>
    </node>
