    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DROSOPHILA MELANOGASTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Drosophila melanogaster is a model insect species used in the study for pathway impact analysis and enrichment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-394b3365ffb36d05dca2ef06bf74e462</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VITAMIN B6&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vitamin B6 is a co-factor in several biochemical reactions, including fatty acid synthesis, and its metabolism is affected by exposure to plastic."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASPARTATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AMINO ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aspartate is an amino acid involved in several metabolic pathways, including the alanine-aspartate-glutamate pathway."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
