      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PYRIDOXINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pyridoxine is a form of vitamin B6, and its depletion is observed in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pyridoxine is a type of nutrient that can improve the activity of recombinant glutamate decarboxylase."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1d40b7debb6497167fa1aec874ebce45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GABA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GABA is a metabolite involved in several metabolic pathways, including the alanine-aspartate-glutamate pathway."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATTY ACID SYNTHESIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fatty acid synthesis is a metabolic pathway affected by the depletion of vitamin B6."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLUTATHIONE METABOLISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Glutathione metabolism is a metabolic pathway involved in the response to oxidative stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Glutathione metabolism is a stress response pathway that is upregulated due to oxidative stress caused by plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NUCLEIC ACIDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRITIONAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nucleic acids are a type of nutrient that is essential for the growth and development of mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nucleic acids are an important component of mealworms' diet, and their synthesis requires nitrogen, which is fixed by gut bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nucleic acids are involved in several metabolic pathways affected by exposure to plastic."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bf827d2b1d02488e17469a22da9e252</data>
    </node>
