      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zebrafish microbiota are microorganisms that have been studied for their response to oxidative stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zebrafish microbiota is affected by oxidative stress caused by plastics, resulting in upregulated stress response pathways."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NUCLEOTIDE METABOLISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nucleotide metabolism is perturbed due to oxidative stress caused by plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INSECT MICROBIOTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Insect microbiota is affected by oxidative stress caused by plastics, and further studies are needed to understand the mechanism."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMARKERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biomarkers are biological markers that are used to measure the health and well-being of organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biomarkers of oxidative stress and plastic toxicity are needed to understand the mechanism of insect microbiota."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ddf4b13293dd3d8d0887af10fc52c98</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BSF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROBE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"BSF is an insect model used to study the effects of plastics on metabolism and microbiota."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8</data>
