      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Brevibacterium sp. is a type of microorganism that is associated with the degradation of polyethylene and is known to be involved in hydrocarbon degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c28d5d503e85e3e6ad15cee35d50e98</data>
