    <node id="&quot;C16:0&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"C16:0 is a fatty acid found in bacteria, with different species having distinct fatty acid profiles."&lt;SEP&gt;"C16:0 is a fatty acid present in the cellular composition of the bacterial species Mixta tenebrionis sp. nov."&lt;SEP&gt;"C16:0 is a fatty acid present in the whole-cell fatty acid composition of Strain BIT-26T and other species of the genus Mixta."&lt;SEP&gt;"C16:0 is a fatty acid that is present in Mixta tenebrionis, indicating its lipid composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"C16:0, also known as palmitic acid, is a type of saturated fatty acid."</data>
