    <node id="&quot;MIXTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mixta is a genus of bacteria that has been found to be present in the gut of mealworms and has nitrogen-fixing abilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mixta is a genus of bacteria that includes the species Mixta tenebrionis sp. nov., characterized by similar fatty acid profiles and phenotypic characteristics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mixta is a genus of microorganisms that includes several species, such as Mixta calida, Mixta gaviniae, and Mixta tenebrionis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mixta is a genus of microorganisms that includes the novel species Strain BIT-26T."</data>
