    <node id="&quot;MLSA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MLSA (Multilocus Sequence Analysis) is a method used to determine the phylogenetic relationships among bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"MLSA stands for multilocus sequence analysis, a method used to study the genetic relationships between different organisms."</data>
