    <node id="&quot;VOGES-PROSKAUER TEST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Voges-Proskauer test is a biochemical test used to characterize Strain BIT-26T, which is positive for this test."&lt;SEP&gt;"Voges-Proskauer test is a biological concept used to determine the ability of bacteria to produce certain compounds."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8d043948723ae25a365e297c98300be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014b72d0a2657cbc89c4dee5f2b32bba</data>
