    <node id="&quot;INDOLE PRODUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indole production is a biological concept used to determine the ability of bacteria to produce indole."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indole production is a biological process that is negative in Mixta tenebrionis, indicating its inability to produce indole."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-146789a250a0dbaae0d8438de692e191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014b72d0a2657cbc89c4dee5f2b32bba</data>
