    <node id="&quot;SALICIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Salicin is a carbohydrate that is used to differentiate Strain BIT-26T from other species of the genus Mixta, based on its ability to produce acids from salicin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Salicin is a nutrient that can be utilized by bacteria, with different species having varying levels of salicin utilization."</data>
