      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EPS foam is a material used to prepare PS film for microbial degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS foam is a type of styrofoam that is being fed to the mealworms, with significant effects on their growth, development, and reproduction."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS foam, or expanded polystyrene foam, is a type of foam that is used as a control in the study of polystyrene waste biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPS foam is a type of expanded polystyrene that can be biodegraded by mealworms, with potential applications in waste management."</data>
