    <node id="&quot;GUT MICROBE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gut microbe is a microorganism that lives in the gut of mealworms and contributes to plastic biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gut microbe is a type of microorganism that lives in the gut of insects, including darkling beetles, and is involved in the biodegradation of polyethylene."</data>
