    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LARVAL GUT MICROBIAL COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Larval gut microbial community is the community of microorganisms that live in the gut of mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Larval gut microbial community refers to the community of microorganisms that live in the gut of insect larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-16328c3c685f35501c3639525e997d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d33654bada6ddaf4917586dd5fd41e9f</data>
