    <node id="&quot;MICROBIAL SUCCESSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbial succession is the process by which the community of microorganisms in the gut of mealworms changes over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbial succession refers to the process by which microorganisms colonize and establish themselves in a new environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16328c3c685f35501c3639525e997d2f</data>
