      <data key="d1">"Disposable surgical masks are a type of product made from plastic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Disposable surgical masks are made of polypropylene material and consist of three layers: an outer layer, a middle layer, and an inner layer, which can be ingested and degraded by yellow mealworms."</data>
