      <data key="d1">"The outer layer is one of the layers of surgical masks, made of nonwoven fabric and ingested by yellow mealworms at a lower rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The outer layer of a surgical mask is made of non-woven fabric and is colored."&lt;SEP&gt;"The outer layer of the surgical mask is one of the layers that is biodegraded by the yellow mealworm."</data>
