      <data key="d2">chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARBON BONDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL BOND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carbon bonds are a type of chemical bond found in plastics, with covalent pairs of carbon bonds having low bio-reactivity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEALWORM MASS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mealworm mass is a measure of the mealworms' growth or decline, affected by the type of plastic consumed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mealworm mass is a measure of the weight of mealworms, which can be affected by the type of plastic they consume."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ff201df58dec460c49cd31920c29f11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIME INTERVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The time interval is a period of time used to measure the effects of plastic consumption on mealworms, with different intervals showing varying results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Time interval is a physical property being studied in the mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Time interval refers to the length of time that mealworms are exposed to a particular plastic, which can affect their mass and viability."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53f87a406d4812c07e783e6cbfc09606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff201df58dec460c49cd31920c29f11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862</data>
