    <node id="&quot;BIOFILMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biofilms are a biological concept that affects the degradation of poly(butylene adipate-co-terephthalate) microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biofilms are communities of microorganisms that adhere to surfaces, which may be related to plastic breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biofilms are communities of microorganisms that live on surfaces and play a crucial role in the biodegradation of plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-825c2784fa66ce67114e4173ed0702f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779ca6b59945309c6bf5040c9fb474ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9095195e9cf06b9887c03abde6284d8</data>
