      <data key="d1">"Soil bacteria are capable of degrading polystyrene, as observed in the morphological structure of polystyrene degraded by soil bacteria from the sarimukti final landfill cipatat bandung."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil bacteria are microorganisms that live in soil and have been found to biodegrade polystyrene."</data>
