      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Acetylene-reducing activity is a measure of nitrogen fixation, and it is used to assess the nitrogen-fixing ability of gut bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acetylene-reducing activity is a measure of nitrogen-fixing activity in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acetylene-reducing activity is a measure of the ability of bacteria to reduce acetylene to ethylene, indicating nitrogen-fixing activity."</data>
