      <data key="d1">"δ15N values are a measure of the nitrogen isotopic ratio, used to determine the source of nitrogen in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"δ15N values are used to analyze the natural stable nitrogen isotope compositions in organisms and provide evidence for the incorporation of fixed nitrogen."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-77817419b966e501f1106866cbea7350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b12451ba2a22e6f74c543f982a0a7b3</data>
