      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Styrofoam-eating mealworms are a group of mealworms that are capable of eating Styrofoam and have nitrogen-fixing activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Styrofoam-eating mealworms are able to survive on a diet of vinyl plastics, which are carbon-rich but nitrogen-deficient, due to the presence of nitrogen-fixing bacteria in their gut."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2bf827d2b1d02488e17469a22da9e252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b12451ba2a22e6f74c543f982a0a7b3</data>
