    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LASER DIRECT INFRARED SPECTROMETRY (LDIR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LDIR is a method used to identify the residual microplastics in the mealworm intestines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laser Direct Infrared Spectrometry (LDIR) is a method used to count and characterize microplastics in the mealworm intestine."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1536c14bdcd58ae9dabf3a49f6724cd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f267b48449a40d614a2f325799752dea</data>
