      <data key="d1">"THF-extracted fraction is a chemical property of the frass, which is used to estimate the residual PS content."&lt;SEP&gt;"The THF-extracted fraction is a component of the biodegradation products of PS polymers, which can be analyzed using various techniques."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70eb294c60e73338ed59a2eddf057c1e</data>
