    <node id="&quot;RESIDUAL PS CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Residual PS content is a chemical property of the frass, which is used to estimate the biodegradation of PS MPs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GEL PERMEATION CHROMATOGRAPHY (GPC) ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gel Permeation Chromatography (GPC) analysis is a biological process used to analyze the molecular weight and depolymerization pattern of PS."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PS-L&quot;">
