    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BROAD DEPOLYMERIZATION (BD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Broad depolymerization (BD) is a pattern of depolymerization where the molecular weight of the polymer chains decreases significantly."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67028993c2650049216602d03fb3f786</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIMITED-EXTENT DEPOLYMERIZATION (LD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Limited-extent depolymerization (LD) is a pattern of depolymerization where the molecular weight of the polymer chains increases due to selective depolymerization of lower-molecular-weight polymers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67028993c2650049216602d03fb3f786</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUNCTIONAL ENZYMES&quot;">
