      <data key="d1">"The PS large group refers to the group of T. molitor larvae that are being fed a diet of Styrofoam chips, and are larger than the PS group, and are being used to study the effects of this diet on growth and development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PS + OAT GROUP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PS + oat group is a concept used in the study to compare the growth and survival of T. molitor larvae under dietary conditions that include PS and oat."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PS + oat group refers to the group of T. molitor larvae that are being fed a diet of Styrofoam chips and oatmeal, and are being used to study the effects of this diet on growth and development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54ed790759cee2111ae15e840cf2c48e</data>
