      <data key="d2">chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STYROFOAM CHIP DIET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL CHARACTERISTIC"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Styrofoam chip diet refers to the diet of Styrofoam chips that is being fed to the PS group of T. molitor larvae, and is being used to study the effects of this diet on growth and development."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRICKET FARM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cricket Farm refers to the location where the T. molitor larvae were obtained, and is being used as a source of insects for the experiment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9</data>
    </node>
