      <data key="d1">"Energy density is a measure of the amount of energy stored in a given unit of mass or volume."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GROWTH PATTERNS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Growth patterns refer to the changes in size and shape of T. molitor larvae over time, which are influenced by the PS diet and the DEB model."&lt;SEP&gt;"Growth patterns refer to the changes in size and shape of T. molitor larvae over time."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f71fddc259d51158d5c79f38bf41523f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARAMETER ESTIMATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
