    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODEL PARAMETERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Model parameters refer to the variables in the DEB model that are used to describe the energy and mass fluxes in T. molitor."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTROL SAMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
