    <edge source="&quot;TENEBRIO MOLITOR&quot;" target="&quot;BRAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">66.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Bran has been found to promote the growth and survival of Tenebrio molitor, suggesting a relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is a diet used to feed Tenebrio molitor larvae, indicating a relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is a nutrient source that can enhance the biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is a nutrient source used to feed the larvae of Tenebrio molitor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is being used as a co-diet for Tenebrio molitor to enhance their survival and mitigate oxidative stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is used as a control diet for Tenebrio molitor in the experiment, indicating a relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is used as a control diet for Tenebrio molitor larvae, and its effect on the larvae is compared to that of plastic foams."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor is fed with bran in laboratory experiments to study its ability to degrade plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is used as a control in experiments with Tenebrio molitor mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is being used to feed the Tenebrio molitor, specifically the yellow mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor is fed bran in the experiment, which affects its gut microbiome."</data>
