    <edge source="&quot;BIODEGRADATION&quot;" target="&quot;PLASTIC POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Biodegradation can mitigate plastic pollution by breaking down plastic waste into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation is a key process in reducing plastic pollution, as it allows for the breakdown of plastic materials into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation is a potential solution to the problem of plastic pollution, as it involves the breakdown of plastic waste into smaller components by microorganisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation is a process that can help reduce plastic pollution by breaking down plastics into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation is a process that can help mitigate plastic pollution by breaking down plastic debris into simpler compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation of plastics, such as PS, is a potential solution to the problem of plastic pollution."</data>
