      <data key="d3">50.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Biodegradation of LDPE involves oxidation, which results in the formation of new functional groups and the breakdown of long chain polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation of PS films involves oxidation, a chemical reaction that breaks down the material."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biodegradation of microplastics by mealworms also involves oxidation, which is a chemical reaction that involves the loss of electrons."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oxidation can occur during biodegradation, leading to the formation of new compounds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Oxidation is a type of chemical reaction that can occur during the biodegradation of polypropylene."</data>
