    <edge source="&quot;BIODEGRADATION&quot;" target="&quot;YANG&quot;">
      <data key="d3">41.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Yang has published studies on biodegradation, indicating a relationship between the researcher and the biological process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang studied the biodegradation of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms, which has implications for environmental remediation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang has written about the biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms, exploring the potential for this approach to reduce plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang has studied the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms and superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang has studied the biodegradation of expanded polystyrene and low-density polyethylene foams by Tenebrio molitor, indicating a relationship between the two entities."</data>
