      <data key="d3">43.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Bran can be used as a food additive to increase polystyrene consumption by superworms, with potential applications in waste management and sustainable bioremediation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran can increase the consumption of PS by superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Superworms are fed bran as a food additive to augment PS consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran can be used as a normal diet for superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is the normal diet of superworms, used as a control to compare with the Styrofoam diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is the normal diet of superworms, which is used as a comparison to the Styrofoam diet to assess the effects of Styrofoam on superworms' activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran is used as feedstock for superworms, providing enough nutrients to complete their life cycle, and is associated with higher pupation rates."</data>
