      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"PVC is a type of plastic that can be ingested and digested by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PVC is a type of plastic that is being compared to PET in terms of biodegradation by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PVC is compared to PET in terms of degradation rates and mass reduction efficiencies, but is not degraded by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The T. molitor larvae are able to degrade PVC with low efficiency, indicating a negative relationship between the two entities."</data>
