    <edge source="&quot;PET&quot;" target="&quot;T. MOLITOR LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">83.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"PET is a type of plastic that can be ingested and digested by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae are able to digest and biodegrade PET, using it as an energy source for their survival and growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae are capable of decomposing PET polymers, with their gut microbiomes playing a role in the degradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae can degrade PET, with their gut microbiota playing a crucial role in this process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The T. molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET microplastics, indicating a direct relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae are involved in the biodegradation of PET, with their digestive gene expression being examined to understand the role of the host in PET biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae biodegrade PET, with different molecular weights of PET being tested for their effect on biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae can biodegrade PET, with a high consumption rate and efficiency, indicating a strong relationship between the two entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"T. molitor larvae can biodegrade PET, with the biodegradation process affected by the molecular weight of the PET."&lt;SEP&gt;"The T. molitor larvae are capable of biodegrading PET, with the extent of biodegradation influenced by factors such as antibiotic suppression and PET molecular weight."</data>
      <data key="d5">"biodegradation, consumption"&lt;SEP&gt;"biodegradation, energy source"&lt;SEP&gt;"biodegradation, host-microbe interaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"biodegradation, molecular weight"&lt;SEP&gt;"biodegradation, plastic degradation"&lt;SEP&gt;"biodegradation, polymer degradation"&lt;SEP&gt;"degradation, metabolism, symbiosis"&lt;SEP&gt;"ingestion, digestion"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-92ea4ca7a83af5c086ae157fb801b326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0efd7a9e4443dc5d3dfe588c7f7efc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a7fb8d6a76ecfbfc810f952bfba090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a88f3ed3eec20cee61421cc094dde89f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b673e7590aa1d03b7721694ed73cd74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61cd3a131593ce6b058802713d43ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5f4bda412174e8b173f180d9b4311ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69679184959639a1ff81c7392cd5cef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5fc4d4324334254706d6d5f9312276</data>
    </edge>
